def: "A specialized epithelial cell involved in sensory perception. Restricted to special sense organs of the olfactory, gustatory, and vestibulocochlear receptor systems; contain sensory cells surrounded by supportive, non-receptive cells." []
comment: The term "neuroepithelial cell" is used to describe both this cell type and neurecto-epithelial cell (CL:0000710).
synonym: "neuroepithelial cell" BROAD []
