[Term]
id: CL:0000589
name: cochlear inner hair cell
namespace: cell
def: "A bulbous cell that is medially placed in one row in the organ of Corti. In contrast to the outer hair cells, the inner hair cells are fewer in number, have fewer sensory hairs, and are less differentiated." []
