relationship: part_of UBERON:0008904 ! neuromast

[Term]
id: CL:0000853
name: olfactory epithelial support cell
namespace: cell
def: "Olfactory epithelial support cell is a columnar cell that extends from the epithelial free margin to the basement membrane of the olfactory epithelium. This cell type has a large, vertically, elongate, euchromatic nucleus, along with other nuclei, forms a layer superficial to the cell body of the receptor cell; sends long somewhat irregular microvilli into the mucus layer; at the base, with expanded end-feet containing numerous lamellated dense bodies resembling lipofuscin of neurons." []
synonym: "olfactory sustentacular cell" EXACT []
synonym: "supporting cell of olfactory epithelium" EXACT []
synonym: "sustentaculocyte of olfactory epithelium" EXACT []
