[Term]
id: CL:0002062
name: type I pneumocyte
namespace: cell
def: "A type I pneumocyte is a flattened, branched pneumocyte that covers more than 98% of the alveolar surface. This large cell has thin (50-100 nm) cytoplasmic extensions to form the air-blood barrier essential for normal gas exchange." []
