is_a: CL:1000746 ! glomerular cell
is_a: CL:1001318 ! renal interstitial pericyte
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002321 ! extraglomerular mesangium
created_by: tmeehan
creation_date: 2010-08-25T02:20:55Z

