[Term]
id: CL:0002285
name: type III taste bud cell
namespace: cell
def: "A taste receptor cell that is characterized by morphologically identifiable synaptic contacts with the gustatory nerve fibers and expression of the synaptic membrane protein-25 (SNAP-25) and NCAM." []
