[Term]
id: CL:0002286
name: type II taste cell
namespace: cell
def: "A taste receptor cell that has a short microvilli, a projecting apical region, a large rounded nucleus, and expresses taste chemoreceptors thus making them the transducing cell for taste qualities." []
synonym: "type 2 taste cell" EXACT []
