[Term]
id: CL:0002365
name: medullary thymic epithelial cell
namespace: cell
def: "An epithelial cell of the medullary thymus. This cell type expresses a diverse range of tissue-specific antigens. This promiscuous gene expression is a cell-autonomous property of medullary epithelial cells and is maintained during the entire period of thymic T cell output." []
