[Term]
id: CL:0011003
name: magnocellular neurosecretory cell (duplicate class)
def: "A neurosecretory neuron residing mainly in the hypothalamic supraoptic and paraventricular nuclei and in a number of smaller accessory cell groups between these two nuclei, that secretes the hormones oxytocin and vasopressin." []
