is_a: FBbt:00007472 ! primary trachea (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0004807 ! respiratory system epithelium
is_a: UBERON:0010371 ! ecto-epithelium
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00005591 ! ganglionic branch primordium (Drosophila)

