[Term]
id: FBbt:00001252
name: surface associated glial cell (Drosophila)
def: "A glial cell that is part of or associated with the surface of the central nervous system, and that is part of the perineurium." [FBC:DOS, FlyBase:FBrf0082171]
is_a: FBbt:00001256 ! CNS glial cell (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001253
