[Term]
id: FBbt:00001599
name: MP1 neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Interneuron residing slightly anterior and ventral to the posterior commissure in the corner formed by the connectives and the posterior commissure (Bossing and Technau, 1994). Its ipsilateral projection bifurcates in an anterior and posterior branch (which spans up to three neuromeres) that run within the medial sector of the connective." [FlyBase:FBrf0072659]
synonym: "Midline precursor 1 cell" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00001446 ! embryonic/larval neuron (Drosophila)
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00001427 ! MP1 precursor (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001600
name: MP1a neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Lateral-most of the two bilateral MP1 neurons found at the midline, anterior to the posterior commissure (Schmid et al., 1999)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049007, FlyBase:FBrf0074503, FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
synonym: "MP1(l)" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00001599 ! MP1 neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001601
name: MP1b neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Medial-most of the two bilateral MP1 neurons found at the midline, anterior to the posterior commissure (Schmid et al., 1999)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049007, FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
is_a: FBbt:00001599 ! MP1 neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001602
name: dMP2 neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Insulinergic intersegmental interneuron that is one of two cells differentiating from neuroblast MP2. It projects posteriorly in a medial fascicle of the connective. Axons from dMP2 neurons innervate the hindgut, forming two fascicles that extend on opposite sides of the hindgut (Miguel-Aliaga et al., 2008). By the adult stage, arbors have formed that innervate the anterior intestines and the rectum. dMP2 neurons perform a pioneer function in embryos then undergo apoptosis in all but segments A1-A9 (Miguel-Aliaga et al., 2008)." [FlyBase:FBrf0112030, FlyBase:FBrf0204880]
synonym: "MP2d" RELATED []
is_a: CL:0000099 ! interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00001446 ! embryonic/larval neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00004101 ! peptidergic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0004121 ! ectoderm-derived structure
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00001382 ! neuroblast MP2 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001603
name: vMP2 neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Intersegmental interneuron that is one of two cells differentiating from neuroblast MP2. It projects anteriorly in a medial fascicle of the connective." [FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
synonym: "MP2v" RELATED []
is_a: CL:0000099 ! interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00001446 ! embryonic/larval neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0004121 ! ectoderm-derived structure
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00001382 ! neuroblast MP2 (Drosophila)

[Term]
