[Term]
id: FBbt:00001643
name: vMP2 tract (Drosophila)
def: "Tract of the ventral nerve cord pioneered by vMP2 which projects anteriorly in a medial fascicle of the connective, and extends across segment boundaries (Schmid et al., 1999; Bossing et al., 1996)." [FlyBase:FBrf0090460, FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
