is_a: FBbt:00001642 ! thoracic-abdominal pioneer tract (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001644
name: MP1 tract (Drosophila)
def: "Tract pioneered by the MP1 neuron in the ventral nerve cord. The MP1 neurons send a bifurcating axon anterior and posterior along two or three segments in a medial fascicle of the longitudinal connectives (Schmid et al., 1999)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049007, FlyBase:FBrf0074503, FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
