is_a: FBbt:00005385 ! ostium (Drosophila)
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00007324 ! embryonic ostial cardioblast (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00001673 ! embryonic/larval dorsal vessel (Drosophila)

