[Term]
id: FBbt:00002303
name: A1-7 DO1 motor neuron (Drosophila)
def: "U1 neuron of A1-7.  It innervates dorsal oblique muscle 1 (FBbt:00000609). Its dendritic arborization occupies the lateral domains of the ventral nerve cord neuropil. It exits the ventral nerve cord via the anterior root of the intersegmental nerve and innervates the DO1 muscle of the next posterior segment with type Ib boutons." [FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0112030, FlyBase:FBrf0132289, FlyBase:FBrf0160715, FlyBase:FBrf0167986, FlyBase:FBrf0174847, FlyBase:FBrf0208790]
