id: FBbt:00002714
name: dorsal pit (Drosophila)
def: "One of 14 innervated pits located in two groups of 7 on either side of the dorsal midline in the dorsal-most part of the head. There is no associated external cuticular sensory structure." [FlyBase:FBrf0034076, FlyBase:FBrf0074007]
