[Term]
id: FBbt:00003379
name: direct flight muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Tubular muscle that inserts on apodemes at the base of the wing hinge and allow for the fine control of movements that are necessary for wing positioning and steering during flight (Kozopas and Nusse, 2002)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0144806]
synonym: "direct wing muscle" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003360 ! flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003380
name: direct flight muscle 49 (Drosophila)
def: "Tergo-pleural muscle extending from the anterior notum to the basalar of the wing (Sink, 2006). It serves to draw the wing horizontally forwards (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "basalar muscle" RELATED []
synonym: "group B muscle" RELATED []
synonym: "prealar muscle 49" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003381
name: direct flight muscle 50 (Drosophila)
def: "Tergo-pleural muscle extending from the notum to the posterior of the basalar. Together with flight muscle 49, it functions to extend the wing (Sink, 2006)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "b1" RELATED []
synonym: "first basalar" RELATED []
synonym: "m.ab. 1" RELATED []
synonym: "m.gracilis" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "muscle of prealar apophysis" RELATED []
synonym: "pa4" RELATED []
synonym: "second basalar muscle" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003382
name: direct flight muscle 58a (Drosophila)
def: "Anterior-most of a pair of direct flight muscles that function to depress the anal portion of the wing (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "muscle 58" RELATED []
synonym: "muscle of axillary cord" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003383
name: direct flight muscle 58b (Drosophila)
def: "Posterior-most of a pair of direct flight muscles that function to depress the anal portion of the wing (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "muscle 58" RELATED []
synonym: "muscle of axillary cord" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003384
name: basalar muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle of the epipleural muscle group that are involved in extending the wing and pulling the anterior wing margin down, thereby pronating the wing (Sink, 2006)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003385
name: basalar muscle 51 (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle that depresses the anterior border of the wing (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "b2" RELATED []
synonym: "m.ab. 2" RELATED []
synonym: "pa3" RELATED []
synonym: "second basalar" RELATED []
synonym: "sternobasalar muscle" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003384 ! basalar muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003386
name: basalar muscle 52 (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle connected to the basalar sclerite more anteriorly than muscle 51." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "3rd & 4th basalar muscle" RELATED []
synonym: "m.an." RELATED []
synonym: "m.anonymous" RELATED []
synonym: "pa6" RELATED []
synonym: "tergopleural" RELATED []
synonym: "tp" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003384 ! basalar muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003387
name: axillary muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle that inserts at one of the wing axillary sclerites (Sink, 2006)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
is_a: FBbt:00003379 ! direct flight muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003388
name: muscle of first axillary 53 (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle connected to the anterior of the first axillary sclerite that, together with muscle 56, serves to raise the wing and draw it backwards (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "anterior muscle of first axillary sclerite" RELATED []
synonym: "first pterale I, I1" RELATED []
synonym: "m.le.1" RELATED []
synonym: "pa3" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003387 ! axillary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003389
name: muscle of third axillary 54 (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle connected to the anterior of the third axillary sclerite that, together with muscle 55, serves to depress the anal portion of the wing (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, ISBN:978-0-387-30053-5]
synonym: "anterior muscle of 3rd axillary sclerite" RELATED []
synonym: "first pterale III, III1" RELATED []
synonym: "m.le.2" RELATED []
synonym: "pa2" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003387 ! axillary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003390
name: muscle of third axillary 55 (Drosophila)
def: "Direct flight muscle connected to the posterior of the third axillary sclerite that, together with muscle 54, serves to depress the anal portion of the wing (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "posterior muscle of the third axillary sclerite" RELATED []
synonym: "third pterale III, III3" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00003387 ! axillary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003391
name: muscle of first axillary 56 (Drosophila)
