[Term]
id: FBbt:00003528
name: adult esophageal muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Visceral muscle of the adult esophagus." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult oesophageal muscle" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003131 ! adult esophagus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003529
name: adult esophageal circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circular muscle of the adult esophagus. There is a single layer of circular muscles forming bands 4-6um wide and 3um thick. The fiber muscles at the anterior end of the esophagus, near the cibarium, are 6-7.5um thick." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003528 ! adult esophageal muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003530
name: adult esophageal sphincter muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circumferential muscle fibers that forms a narrow band around the esophagus, at the anterior end of the cardia." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518]
synonym: "cardiac sphincter" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0048518]
is_a: FBbt:00003528 ! adult esophageal muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003532
name: adult crop circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circular muscle fibers of the of adult crop. In the stalk, it consists of wide bands 1.5um thick and 3-7um wide. In the sac, thick muscle fibers extend around the base of each lobe, converging posteriorly, and the distended portions of the wall are covered with a plexus of branched and interlacing fibers 1-3um thick." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003133 ! crop (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003533
name: adult cardial muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Thin scattering of muscle fibers that covers the outer layer of the adult proventriculus (cardia). It is one cell thick, except at the anterior end of the proventriculus, where the muscle of the outer layer meets the muscle of the esophagus." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0048518]
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003139 ! adult proventriculus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003534
name: adult midgut muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle of the adult midgut. These muscles surround the thick epithelium and are loosely lined by a peritrophic membrane. The musculature of the hindgut is weakly developed (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult ventriculus muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003138 ! adult midgut (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003535
name: adult midgut circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circular muscle of the adult midgut. Circular muscles are surrounded by the outer longitudinal fibers." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult ventriculus circular muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003527 ! adult circular muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00003534 ! adult midgut muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003536
name: adult midgut longitudinal muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Longitudinal muscle of the adult midgut. The longitudinal fibers surround the circular muscle fibers." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult ventriculus longitudinal muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003526 ! adult longitudinal muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00003534 ! adult midgut muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003537
name: hindgut muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle fibers of the hindgut, the posterior part of the alimentary canal. It contains longitudinal and circular muscle fibers." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "intestine muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00005070 ! visceral muscle (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001046 ! hindgut

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003539
name: adult posterior hindgut circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circular muscle of the adult posterior hindgut, located as an outside layer to the inner longitudinal fibers. It is a single layer of thick, closely set circular fibers. Muscular fibers are 3um thick and 10um wide in the rectal sac, and 3-5um thick in the posterior rectum." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult posterior intestine circular muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003527 ! adult circular muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00110919 ! adult hindgut muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0016886 ! muscle tissue of terminal part of digestive tract
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003144 ! posterior adult hindgut (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003540
name: adult posterior hindgut longitudinal muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Longitudinal muscle of the adult posterior hindgut, located as an inside layer to the outer circular fibers. Longitudinal fibers are 3-5um wide and 1um thick." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "adult posterior intestine longitudinal muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003526 ! adult longitudinal muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00110919 ! adult hindgut muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0016886 ! muscle tissue of terminal part of digestive tract
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003144 ! posterior adult hindgut (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003541
name: rectal circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Circular muscle of the adult narrow posterior end of the rectum, that forms part of the adult rectal sphincter. The rectal epithelium forms numerous longitudinal folds and the circular muscles act as an anal sphincter." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003527 ! adult circular muscle (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0016886 ! muscle tissue of terminal part of digestive tract
relationship: part_of FBbt:00100783 ! adult rectal sac (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003542
name: adult salivary gland suspensor muscle (Drosophila)
def: "A muscle that extends from the anterior end of the salivary gland to the cardia. (Miller, 1950 pg 440-1, 451)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003135 ! adult salivary gland (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003543
name: adult heart muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle of the adult that is associated with the heart." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: CL:0002494 ! cardiocyte
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of UBERON:0015230 ! dorsal vessel heart

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003544
name: adult heart suspensory fibril (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00003543 ! adult heart muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003545
name: adult alary muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Bilateral adult heart muscle that is involved in modulation of the flow of hemolymph into the cardiac tube, and support of the dorsal vessel during locomotion." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0208061]
synonym: "AlMsc" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "am" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0208061]
is_a: FBbt:00003543 ! adult heart muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003546
name: adult alary muscle 1 (Drosophila)
def: "Anterior most of the alary muscles, connecting the adult heart, close to ostia 1, to the front edge of the third abdominal tergite." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003545 ! adult alary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003547
name: adult alary muscle 2 (Drosophila)
def: "Second anterior-most of the alary muscles, connecting the adult heart, close to ostia 2, to the front edge of the fourth abdominal tergite." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003545 ! adult alary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003548
name: adult alary muscle 3 (Drosophila)
def: "Third anterior-most of the alary muscles, connecting the adult heart, close to ostia 3, to the front edge of the fifth abdominal tergite." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003545 ! adult alary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003549
name: adult alary muscle 4 (Drosophila)
def: "Posterior-most of the alary muscles, connecting the adult heart, close to ostia 4, to the front edge of the fifth abdominal tergite." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003545 ! adult alary muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003550
name: adult heart ventral longitudinal muscle (Drosophila)
synonym: "ventral adult heart longitudinal muscle" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003543 ! adult heart muscle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003551
name: ejaculatory bulb muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle fibres that stretch from the end of the ejaculatory bulb apodeme to the side walls." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: UBERON:0001135 ! smooth muscle tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004962 ! ejaculatory bulb (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003552
name: penis protractor muscle (Drosophila)
def: "Muscle of the adult male 9th sternite that originates from the basal part of the sternite and inserts upon the base of the penis. There is a pair of these muscles." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734]
synonym: "aedeagus protractor muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007734]
is_a: FBbt:00003551 ! ejaculatory bulb muscle (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004852 ! penis (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003553
name: common oviduct circular muscle (Drosophila)
def: "A striated array of circular muscle fibers forming an almost continuous sheet around the common oviduct." [FlyBase:FBrf0193596]
is_a: CL:0002078 ! meso-epithelial cell
is_a: FBbt:00003527 ! adult circular muscle (Drosophila)
