[Term]
id: FBbt:00003649
name: ring neuron (Drosophila)
def: "A large field neuron that forms ring-shaped arborizations in the ellipsoid body that circle the ellipsoid body canal. These arborizations may form complete or partial rings." [FlyBase:FBrf0049409]
