def: "Ring neuron R that arborizes only in the outer ring of the ellipsoid body. Arborizing branches originate in the ellipsoid body canal and radiate outwards." [FlyBase:FBrf0049409, FlyBase:FBrf0111476, FlyBase:FBrf0210156]
