is_a: FBbt:00003661 ! extrinsic pb neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003664
name: intrinsic neuron (Drosophila)
def: "A neuron arborizing exclusively within a given neuropil domain. Intrinsic (local) interneurons may be ipsilateral, restricted to one of side of a paired neuropil domain, or bilateral, extending a process across the midline and arborizing in both sides of a pair of bilaterally symmetric neuropil domains." [FBC:DOS, FBC:SPR, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/terms/terms.html]
synonym: "local interneuron" EXACT []
is_a: CL:0000099 ! interneuron

