is_a: CL:0000402 ! CNS interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00001366 ! supraesophageal ganglion neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007484 ! mushroom body intrinsic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00110577 ! adult MBp lineage neuron (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003684 ! adult mushroom body (Drosophila)

