def: "Medullary intrinsic neuron with both fine and bleb-type arborizations in medulla layers M3, M4, M5 and M8, but with only fine arborizations in medulla layer M9. It is a GABAergic neuron." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0213020, FlyBase:FBrf0220286]
synonym: "medullary intrinsic neuron Mi10" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
