[Term]
id: FBbt:00003871
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn1 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that arborizes with fine and bleb-type terminals in lobula layers 5 and 6. It is a cholinergic neuron (Varija Raghu et al., 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0212356]
synonym: "LC1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10004]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn1" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007173 ! cholinergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003872
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn2 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that arborizes in lobula layers 3-5. The distal part of this arborization is fine and bushy while the proximal part has thick projections with bleb-type terminals. It is a cholinergic neuron (Varija Raghu et al., 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0212356]
synonym: "LC2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10005]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn2" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007173 ! cholinergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003873
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn3 (Drosophila)
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn3" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003874
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn4 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that has a fine terminal arborization in lobula layers 2, 3 and 4. It projects to an optic glomerulus in the ventrolateral protocerebrum. There are an estimated 31-36 cells in this class: 25-29 having their cell bodies in the mid-ventral area of the lateral cell body region, and 6-7 located in its anterior area. It is a glutamatergic neuron (Raghu and Borst, 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
synonym: "LC4" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn4" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00100291 ! glutamatergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003875
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn5 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that branches in lobula layer 5 with the branches forming fine terminal arbors in lobula layers 4, 5 and 6. It seems to be capable of both glutamatergic and GABAergic neurotransmission." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0213690, FlyBase:FBrf0220286]
synonym: "LC5" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10006]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn5" EXACT []
is_a: CL:0011005 ! GABAergic interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007228 ! GABAergic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00100291 ! glutamatergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003876
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn6 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that branches and arborizes in the lobula with a mix of bleb-type and fine terminals in layers 3-6. It fasciculates in the anterior optic tract, fasciculating with Lcn9 (Otsuna and Ito, 2006), and innervates an optic glomerulus in the lateral-most area of the dorsal-posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0193607]
synonym: "LC6" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10006]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn6" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003877
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn7 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that enters the lobula at its proximal surface. It has sparse, thin colaterals along its length up to layer 2 where it forms a broad arborization with blebs, and finer arborizations that extend into layer 3." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "LC7" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10007]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn7" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003878
name: lobula columnar neuron Lcn8 (Drosophila)
def: "An extrinsic columnar neuron that branches multiple times in layers 5 and 4 and forms a broad arborization in layer 3 with both bleb-type and fine terminals. It is a glutamatergic neuron (Raghu and Borst, 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
synonym: "LC8" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0193607, FlyBrain_NDB:10008]
synonym: "lobular columnar neuron Lcn8" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003870 ! lobula columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00100291 ! glutamatergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003879
name: lobula complex columnar neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Extrinsic columnar neuron of the optic lobe that innervates both the lobula and the lobula plate." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "LCCN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "Lccn" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "lobular complex columnar neuron" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003660 ! extrinsic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00005129 ! columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003880
name: lobula complex columnar neuron Lccn1 (Drosophila)
def: "Extrinsic columnar neuron of the optic lobe that enters the lobula plate proximally. It bifurcates in the proximal lobula with both branches innervating both the lobula and the lobula plate. Between them the two branches innervate all layers of the lobula and lobula plate." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "Lccn1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBrain_NDB:10008]
synonym: "lobular complex columnar neuron Lccn1" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003879 ! lobula complex columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003881
name: lobula complex columnar neuron Lccn2 (Drosophila)
def: "Extrinsic columnar neuron of the optic lobe whose soma lies in the cortex of the lobula plate. It bifurcates close to the soma, with one branch entering the lobula plate and in which it arborizes with both fine and bleb-type terminals at layers 1-4. It terminates in lobula layer 4 with an arbor that also has both fine and bleb-type terminals. It is a GABAergic neuron." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0220286]
synonym: "Lccn2" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10035]
synonym: "lobular complex columnar neuron Lccn2" EXACT []
is_a: CL:0011005 ! GABAergic interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00003879 ! lobula complex columnar neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007228 ! GABAergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003882
name: lobula intrinsic neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Columnar neuron that innervates only the lobula." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "Li" EXACT []
synonym: "lobular intrinsic neuron" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00007578 ! intrinsic columnar neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003883
name: lobula intrinsic neuron Li1 (Drosophila)
def: "Neuron whose cell body lies in the cortex of the lobula. It displays both fine and bleb-like terminals in lobula layers 4, 5 and 6. It is a glutamatergic neuron (Raghu and Borst, 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
synonym: "Li1" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10095]
synonym: "lobular intrinsic neuron Li1" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003882 ! lobula intrinsic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00100291 ! glutamatergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003884
name: lobula intrinsic neuron Li2 (Drosophila)
def: "Neuron whose cell body lies in the cortex proximal to the lobula and that projects along the posterior edge of the lobula and then along the plane of lobula layer 1 where it arborizes with both fine and bleb-type terminals." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410]
synonym: "Li2" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10184]
synonym: "lobular intrinsic neuron Li2" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00003882 ! lobula intrinsic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003885
name: lobula plate (Drosophila)
def: "Posterior domain of the lobula complex. It is divided into 4 layers and houses many large tangential neurons." [http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem3.html, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/horizschem1.htmll, VFB_vol:00003885]
