[Term]
id: FBbt:00003980
name: adult antennal nerve (Drosophila)
def: "Nerve carrying the majority of afferents to the antennal lobe. Near its entrance to the brain it consists of about 1700-1800 axons. Approximately 1200 of these are sensory fibers from the third antennal segment, mainly axons from olfactory receptor neurons that project into the antennal lobe ventrally, at its antero-ventral corner (Stocker and Gendre, 1988; Kamikouchi et al., 2006). The remaining 500-600 fibers stem mainly from Johnston's organ neurons and mechanosensory sensilla of the anterior head capsule (Kamikouchi et al., 2006). These axons bypass the antennal lobe and target various neuropil domains including the antennal mechanosensory and motor center." [FlyBase:FBrf0047813, FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0194812, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas//schematic/frontschem1.html]
synonym: "AN" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
is_a: FBbt:00006045 ! antennal nerve (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0011779 ! nerve of head region
relationship: part_of FBbt:00005892 ! adult peripheral nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003012 ! adult antennal segment

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003981
name: tegumentary nerve (Drosophila)
def: "The bilateral tegumentary nerves contain axons from mechanoreceptors on the head capsule of the adult brain. Axon fibers innervate the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (AMMC) and may continue into the gnathal ganglion and thoracico-abdominal ganglion." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "nervus tegumentalis" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0002274]
synonym: "TgN" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "TgNv" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: UBERON:0011779 ! nerve of head region
relationship: part_of FBbt:00005892 ! adult peripheral nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003007 ! insect adult head

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003982
name: antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Drosophila)
def: "Neuropil domain located in the deutocerebrum, postero-ventral to the antennal lobe. It contains the terminals of mechanosensory fibers mainly from the first and second antennal segments, most of which come from Johnston's organ neurons." [FlyBase:FBrf0194812, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/terms/terms.html, VFB_vol:00003982]
synonym: "AMC" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0187921]
synonym: "AMMC" EXACT []
synonym: "antennal mechanosensory region" EXACT []
synonym: "antenno-mechanosensory center" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0187921]
synonym: "dorsal lobe" RELATED [PMID:2648971]
relationship: part_of FBbt:00045048 ! saddle (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003983
name: lateral antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
def: "Tract that emerges from the posterior ventral part of the antennal lobe, at the horizontal level of the top of the V glomerulus (ventral root). It runs posteriorly, turns dorsolaterally and runs through the ventrolateral protocerebrum to project to the medial periphery of the lateral horn. It contains axons of antennal lobe projection neurons." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0219793, FlyBase:FBrf0219809, FlyBase:FBrf0224194, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem2.html]
synonym: "lALT" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "lAPT" EXACT []
synonym: "lateral antennal lobe-protocerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "oACT" EXACT []
synonym: "outer antenno-cerebral tract" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00100099 ! adult antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0007702 ! tract of brain
relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003984
name: mediolateral antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
def: "Tract that arises from the posterior dorsomedial antennal lobe and shares the same root with the medial antennal lobe tract (dorsomedial root). It connects the antennal lobe and the lateral horn directly, bypassing the mushroom body calyx. It contains axons of antennal lobe projection neurons. Neuronal fibers of the mlALT run together with the medial antennal lobe tract (mALT) and separate from it at the level of the ventrolateral surface of the fan-shaped body, turn laterally, run below the mushroom body pedunculus and project to the lateral horn. It demarcates the boundaries of the fan-shaped body (anterior region), lateral accessory lobe (posterior region), epaulette (superior region), inferior clamp (anterior-superior region) and mushroom body pedunculus (inferior region)." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0205263, FlyBase:FBrf0219793, FlyBase:FBrf0219809, FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "mACT" EXACT []
synonym: "medial antenno-cerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "medial antennocerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "median antenno-cerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "middle antenno-cerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "middle antennocerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "middle antennoglomerular tract" EXACT []
synonym: "mlALT" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "mlAPT" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00100099 ! adult antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0007702 ! tract of brain
relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003985
name: medial antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
def: "A tract of about 200 axons that emerges from the posterior dorsomedial area of the antennal lobe (dorsomedial root), runs dorsoposteriorly along the posterior surface of the fan-shaped body, turns laterally in front of the protocerebral bridge, passes in front of the mushroom body calyx and terminates in the lateral horn. It contains axons of antennal lobe projection neurons. It demarcates the boundaries of the lateral accessory lobe (medial region), vest (superior region), epaulette (medial region), fan-shaped body (lateral region), gorget (superior region), inferior clamp (lateral and superior-lateral regions), inferior bridge (superior-lateral region), antler (lateral region), superior clamp (posterior-superior region), mushroom body calyx (anterior region) and superior lateral protocerebrum (inferior region)." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0219793, FlyBase:FBrf0219809, FlyBase:FBrf0224194, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem3.html, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/horizschem1.html, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/sagschem2.html]
synonym: "AGT" EXACT []
synonym: "antenno-glomerular tract" EXACT []
synonym: "iACT" EXACT []
synonym: "inner antenno-cerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "inner antennocerebral tract" EXACT []
synonym: "inner antennoglomerular tract" EXACT []
synonym: "mALT" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "tractus olfactorio-globularis" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00100099 ! adult antennal lobe tract (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0007702 ! tract of brain
relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

