is_a: FBbt:00005123 ! motor neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004024
name: accessory pharyngeal nerve (Drosophila)
def: "The ~5um thick accessory pharyngeal nerve of the adult brain (Miller, 1950) contains axons connecting with the lower, anterior half of the adult head capsule including sensory organs along the esophagus. The two contralateral nerves fuse with the pharyngeal nerves in their exit from the gnathal ganglion, probably from the mandibular neuromere, but penetrate at a lower level into the space between the anterior cibarial plate and the dilator muscles. From here, the nerve enters the labrum to connect with its muscles and sense organs." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "AcPhyNv" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "APhN" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
is_a: UBERON:0011779 ! nerve of head region
relationship: part_of FBbt:00005892 ! adult peripheral nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003007 ! insect adult head

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004025
name: ventral cibarial sense organ neuron of proximal sensillum (Drosophila)
def: "Gustatory receptor neuron that innervates the proximal sensillum of the ventral cibarial sense organ of the adult pharynx. There are two of these per sensillum." [FlyBase:FBrf0068700, FlyBase:FBrf0074012, FlyBase:FBrf0167539]
synonym: "VCSO GRN" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0200422]
is_a: FBbt:00110883 ! ventral cibarial sense organ neuron (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00100156 ! proximal sensillum of ventral cibarial sense organ (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004026
name: labral sense organ neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Sensory neuron that innervates the adult labral sense organ of the adult pharynx. There are 18 of these, 8 mechanosensory and 10 gustatory receptor neurons." [FlyBase:FBrf0074012, FlyBase:FBrf0167539]
is_a: CL:0000101 ! sensory neuron
is_a: FBbt:00005163 ! sensory organ cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004146 ! adult labral sense organ (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004027
