def: "." [FlyBase:FBrf0074012]
is_a: UBERON:0001021 ! nerve
relationship: part_of FBbt:00005892 ! adult peripheral nervous system (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004028
name: adult labial nerve (Drosophila)
def: "The labial nerve is a mixed sensory-motor nerve of the gnathal ganglion (GNG). It contains axons from sensory cells of the labium entering the labial neuromere of the GNG. The ~10um adult labial nerve arises from the ventral side of the GNG. Proximally, it gives off branches to the basiproboscis and haustellum (a branch consisting of ~10 motorneurons (Nayak and Singh, 1983)), and the labellar glands and sense organs (Miller, 1950). The labial nerve is anastomosed with the maxillary nerve until the latter branches off to the maxillary palpus (Nayak and Singh, 1983)." [FlyBase:FBrf0042883]
synonym: "labellar nerve" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "LbN" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "LbNv" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "LN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0179479]
synonym: "maxillar labellar nerve" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "maxillar labial nerve" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "maxillary-labial nerve" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00100333 ! labial nerve (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0011779 ! nerve of head region
relationship: part_of FBbt:00005892 ! adult peripheral nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003007 ! insect adult head

