relationship: part_of FBbt:00004529 ! posterior plate of cibarium (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004146
name: adult labral sense organ (Drosophila)
def: "Sense organ that extends along the adult hypopharynx. It comprises a heterogeneous group of nine sensilla, numbered from proximal to distal, containing a total of 8 mechanosensory and 10 gustatory receptor neurons. It develops from the epiphysis (larval labral sense organ)." [FlyBase:FBrf0035962, FlyBase:FBrf0074012, FlyBase:FBrf0167539]
