def: "Sensillum trichodeum located at the distal end of the rostral membrane of the adult head, near to the insertion of the palpus. There are two to four of these." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004, FlyBase:FBrf0044923]
synonym: "PalP" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0044923]
