synonym: "Prst" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0044923]
is_a: FBbt:00004167 ! rostral sensillum (Drosophila)
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00110818 ! presumptive proximal rostral sensillum (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004170
name: postgenal sensillum (Drosophila)
def: "Sensillum trichodeum of the postgena of the adult head, located in the medial region, ventral to the premandibular bristles. There is a group of these." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004, FlyBase:FBrf0044923]
