relationship: develops_from FBbt:00110833 ! presumptive postgenal sensillum (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004496 ! postgena (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004172
name: antennal segment 3 sensillum (Drosophila)
def: "Any sense organ (FBbt:00005155) that is part of some third segment of antenna (FBbt:00004515)." [FBC:auto_generated_definition]
is_a: FBbt:00007151 ! adult antennal sense organ (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004515 ! third segment of antenna (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004173
name: sensillum trichodeum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)
def: "Olfactory sensillum of antennal segment 3 whose external sensory part is a sharply pointed hair arising from a conspicuous cylindrical base. The walls of the hair are perforated by irregularly distributed pores connecting to a lymph filled lumen containing 1-3 ORN dendrites, unbranched except occasionally near the hair tip." [FlyBase:FBrf0104820, FlyBase:FBrf0128642]
is_a: FBbt:00004172 ! antennal segment 3 sensillum (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00005184 ! sensillum trichodeum (Drosophila)
