is_a: FBbt:00005185 ! sensillum basiconicum (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007241 ! adult head sensillum (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004175
name: large sensillum basiconicum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)
def: "Large, blunt tipped, olfactory basiconic sensillum of antennal segment 3. The external sensory structure is perforated by pores, arranged along a complicated pattern of branched lines, that connect to a lymph-filled lumen containing the highly branched dendrites of 2-4 ORNs." [FlyBase:FBrf0104820, FlyBase:FBrf0128642]
is_a: FBbt:00004174 ! sensillum basiconicum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)
