def: "A campaniform sensillum that is one of around 40 sensilla arranged in 10 transverse rows on the dorsal side of the pedicel. The central cuticular specialisation has a raised profile, and the sockets are oval-shaped and fused to the sockets of adjacent sensilla in the same row." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004, FlyBase:FBrf0038304]
synonym: "d.Ped" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0038304]
synonym: "dPS" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
