relationship: part_of UBERON:6004540 ! basiproboscis

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004544
name: mentum (Drosophila)
def: "The distal part of the labium originally paired, secondarily fused into one broad plate bearing on its apical margin usually a prementum, and the paired appendages of the labial palp, the glossa and the paraglossa. In the context of Drosophila refers to the adult maxillary structures." [FBC:gg, FlyBase:FBrf0166419]
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004543 ! adult maxillary structure (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004545
name: maxillary lobe (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004543 ! adult maxillary structure (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004546
name: maxillary palpus (Drosophila)
def: "The paired sensory appendage of the adult maxillary segment, located laterally on the proboscis. It is covered with stout hairs, and on the dorsal side with sensilla basiconica similar to those of antennal segment 3. There are four long slender bristles locate distally and about 16 small bristles in a longitudinal band on the posterior surface." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004, FlyBase:FBrf0166419]
synonym: "palpus" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
is_a: UBERON:0000026 ! appendage
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00110816 ! presumptive maxillary palpus (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004545 ! maxillary lobe (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004547
name: salivary stylet (Drosophila)
def: "Papilla located just posterior to the oral opening that bears the opening of the adult salivary duct at its apex." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734]
is_a: UBERON:6007288 ! insect integumentary specialisation
relationship: part_of UBERON:6004481 ! adult external head

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004548
name: cervical sclerite (Drosophila)
def: "A small sclerite of the neck. There are 2 pairs, located laterally on either side of the neck. The anterior plate is extremely small and partially fused to the posterior plate." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734]
is_a: UBERON:6004475 ! sclerite
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004550 ! neck (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004549
name: cervical suture (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00004479 ! suture (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6004481 ! adult external head

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004550
name: neck (Drosophila)
def: "Structure connecting the head to the body, through which the esophagus, cervical connective, two salivary gland ducts, two tracheal trunks and two stomodeal nerves pass." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734]
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003020 ! adult prothoracic segment

