[Term]
id: FBbt:00004755
name: costal vein (Drosophila)
synonym: "costa" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004756
name: distal costal vein (Drosophila)
def: "Distal-most of the three segments of the costal vein. It bears two rows of widely spaced, recurved microchaetae and two large macrochaetae at its distal tip." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
synonym: "DCo" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
is_a: FBbt:00084751 ! wing vein segment (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004755 ! costal vein (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004757
name: medial costal vein (Drosophila)
def: "Second most proximal (middle) segment of the costal vein. It bears 8 microchaetae, one of which curves away from the cuticle, and a single macrochaeta." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
synonym: "MCo" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
is_a: FBbt:00084751 ! wing vein segment (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004755 ! costal vein (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004758
name: proximal costal vein (Drosophila)
def: "Proximal-most segment of the costal vein. It bears two rows (dorsal an ventral) of bracted microchaetae with a single unbracted microchaeta between the two rows." [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
synonym: "PCo" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0031004]
is_a: FBbt:00084751 ! wing vein segment (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004755 ! costal vein (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004759
name: wing vein L1 (Drosophila)
def: "The anterior-most longitudinal vein of the wing blade. This vein follows the anterior wing margin." [FBC:DOS]
synonym: "marginal vein" RELATED []
synonym: "radius 1" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004760
name: wing vein L2 (Drosophila)
def: "The second most anterior longitudinal vein of the wing blade." [FBC:DOS]
synonym: "radius 2-5" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004761
name: wing vein L3 (Drosophila)
def: "The third most anterior longitudinal vein of the wing blade." [FBC:DOS]
synonym: "dorsal radius" RELATED []
synonym: "medial anterior" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004762
name: wing vein L4 (Drosophila)
def: "The fourth most anterior longitudinal vein of the wing blade." [FBC:DOS]
synonym: "cubitus vein" RELATED []
synonym: "medial posterior and cubitus anterior" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004763
name: wing vein L5 (Drosophila)
def: "The fifth most anterior longitudinal vein of the wing blade." [FBC:DOS]
