name: wing vein L6 (Drosophila)
synonym: "anal crossvein" RELATED []
synonym: "cubitus anterior and 1 anal vein" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004765
name: crossvein (Drosophila)
def: "A short wing that runs anterior-posterior, joining two longitudinal wing veins." [FBC:DOS]
is_a: UBERON:0003194 ! imaginal disc-derived wing vein

