[Term]
id: FBbt:00006007
name: outer photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)
def: "An eye photoreceptor cell whose rhabdomere is part of the outer trapezoid of rhabdomeres of each ommatidium. There are six of these per ommatidium. Each has a single axon that projects along a single lamina optic cartridge within which it makes extensive synaptic connections before terminating in the proximal lamina. This axon is presynaptic to lamina monopolar cells L1, L2 and L3 (at tetrad synapses), but also postsynaptic at (dyad) feedback synapses from L4 (collaterals from adjacent columns) (Meinertzhagen and O'Neil, 1991)." [FlyBase:FBrf0054529, FlyBase:FBrf0064798]
synonym: "photoreceptor cell R1-6" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00006009 ! eye photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00006008
name: inner photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)
def: "Eye photoreceptor cell whose rhabdomere is located in the centre of each ommatidium." [FlyBase:FBrf0064798]
is_a: FBbt:00006009 ! eye photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00006009
name: eye photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)
def: "Photoreceptor cell that forms the core of each ommatidium in the adult eye. Eight of these photoreceptors are arranged in each ommatidial core, bundled like the staves of a barrel. Each has a photosensitive rhabdomere that projects into the barrel cavity and adjacent supporting membrane, the stalk (Wolff and Ready, 1993). Each extends an axon into the optic lobe. Activation of the photoreceptor by light results in depolarization and in histamine release at the synapses of these axons (Sarthy, 1991)." [FlyBase:FBrf0054495, FlyBase:FBrf0064798]
synonym: "lamina receptor cell" EXACT []
is_a: CL:0000488 ! visible light photoreceptor cell
is_a: CL:0009001 ! compound eye retinal cell
is_a: CL:0009004 ! retinal cell
is_a: CL:2000019 ! compound eye photoreceptor cell
is_a: CL:2000032 ! peripheral nervous system neuron
is_a: FBbt:00003702 ! optic lobe neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00005163 ! sensory organ cell (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007251 ! rhabdomeric photoreceptor cell (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007367 ! histaminergic neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0004121 ! ectoderm-derived structure
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000971 ! ommatidium

