def: "Neuron that supports clock-gene oscillations under light:dark cycles or constant conditions, and participates in control of the diurnal rhythm of the organism." [FlyBase:FBrf0093121, FlyBase:FBrf0105254, FlyBase:FBrf0195358]
synonym: "clock neuron" RELATED []
is_a: CL:0000540 ! neuron

[Term]
id: FBbt:00006049
name: escort cell (Drosophila)
def: "Somatic cell type with squamous morphology found in regions 1 and 2a of the germarium. These cells send out thin cytoplasmic processes which envelop cystoblasts and cysts for several days prior to follicle cell formation. They move posteriorly with developing cystoblasts but do not cross the 2a/2b boundary in the germarium, instead undergoing apoptosis when they reach it." [FlyBase:FBrf0190200]
synonym: "inner germarium sheath cell" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0190200]
is_a: FBbt:00100318 ! somatic cell (Drosophila)
relationship: develops_from FBbt:00006050 ! escort stem cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004866 ! germarium (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00006050
name: escort stem cell (Drosophila)
def: "A type of somatic stem cell with a thin, elongate morphology. 4-6 of these cells are present in each germarium where they surround and extensively contact adjacent female germline stem cells." [FlyBase:FBrf0190200]
is_a: FBbt:00006010 ! gonadal somatic stem cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004867 ! germarium region 1 (Drosophila)

