[Term]
id: FBbt:00007069
name: centro-posterior lateral synaptic neuropil domain (Drosophila)
def: "A synaptic neuropil domain of the larval brain located posterior to the medial lobe of the mushroom body. It is separated from the centro-posterior medial compartment by the peduncle." [FlyBase:FBrf0155900]
synonym: "centro-posterior lateral neuropil compartment" EXACT []
synonym: "CPL" EXACT []
synonym: "larval inferior lateral protocerebrum" EXACT []
