[Term]
id: FBbt:00007072
name: anterior dorsal commissure (Drosophila)
def: "A commissure located anterior and dorsal of the fan-shaped body which connects the two superior lateral protocerebrum synaptic neuropil domains of the adult brain." [ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
synonym: "DAC1" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005970 ! brain commissure
relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007073
name: frontal median commissure (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure located dorsal and anterior to of the fan-shaped body which connects the two superior medial protocerebrum neuropils of the adult brain." [ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
