[Term]
id: FBbt:00007074
name: lateral accessory lobe commissure (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure connecting the lateral accessory lobes running in front of the ellipsoid body, dorsal and anterior of the fan-shaped body of the adult brain." [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
