[Term]
id: FBbt:00007075
name: superior arch commissure (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure located above the fan-shaped body (FB), connecting the superior medial protocerebrum (SMP), superior clamp and inferior clamp. It demarcates the boundaries of FB (superior region) and SMP (inferior region)." [FlyBase:FBrf0224194, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem2.html, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/sagschem1.html, ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
