[Term]
id: FBbt:00007076
name: anterior cross (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure located dorsal and anterior of the fan-shaped body which links the two superior medial and lateral protocerebra of the adult brain." [ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
is_a: FBbt:00007084 ! midline crossing tract (Drosophila)
is_a: UBERON:0007702 ! tract of brain
relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007077
name: superior posterior lateral protocerebrum commissure (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure of the adult brain that is located dorsal to the mushroom body pedunculus and between the fan-shaped body and antler. It passes near the lateral horn but does not enter the neuropil. It demarcates the boundary between the superior and inferior clamp." [FlyBase:FBrf0224194, ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
synonym: "c l ho" EXACT []
synonym: "commissure of lateral horn" EXACT []
