relationship: part_of UBERON:6110636 ! adult cerebral ganglion

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007078
name: sub-ellipsoid commissure (Drosophila)
def: "Commissure located anterior and ventral of the fan-shaped body that connects left and right ventral bodies." [ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7]
synonym: "su e c" EXACT []
synonym: "VAC3" EXACT []
