synonym: "apical glial cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0206543]
synonym: "neural lamella" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0214261]
synonym: "perineural sheath" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0000479 ! simple tissue
relationship: part_of FBbt:00007090 ! perineurium (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007090
name: perineurium (Drosophila)
def: "The outer two layers of glial cells that cover the central nervous system and the nerves. The outer layer is the perineurial sheath (sometimes referred to as the perineurial sheath outer layer); the inner layer is the sub-perineural glial sheath (sometimes referred to as the perineurial sheath inner layer)." [FlyBase:FBrf0057603, FlyBase:FBrf0191040, ISBN:978-0-7204-7136-6]
is_a: UBERON:0000073 ! regional part of nervous system

