id: FBbt:00007335
name: embryonic/larval intercalary segment sense organ (Drosophila)
def: "Any sense organ (FBbt:00005155) that is part of some larval intercalary segment (FBbt:00001736)." [FBC:auto_generated_definition]
synonym: "larval intercalary segment sense organ" EXACT []
