[Term]
id: FBbt:00007352
name: antennal olfactory receptor neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Odorant receptor neuron (ORN) whose dendrite transduces signals from some antennal sensillum. The axons of these neurons fasciculate in the antennal nerve and innervate the antennal lobe." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437]
