[Term]
id: FBbt:00007353
name: maxillary palp olfactory receptor neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Odorant receptor neuron (ORN) whose dendrite transduces signals from some maxillary palp basiconic sensillum. The axons of these neurons fasciculate in the labial nerve and the antenno-subesophageal tract (AST) and innervate the antennal lobe." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437]
