is_a: FBbt:00003636 ! pontine neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007525
name: pontine neuron P3 (Drosophila)
def: "Pontine neuron of the fan-shaped body that connects adjacent layers within one segment." [FlyBase:FBrf0210154]
is_a: FBbt:00003636 ! pontine neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007526
name: pontine neuron P4 (Drosophila)
def: "Pontine neuron of the fan-shaped body that arborizes in a single segment and connects dorsal and ventral layers." [FlyBase:FBrf0210154]
is_a: FBbt:00003636 ! pontine neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007527
name: pontine neuron P1a (Drosophila)
def: "Pontine neuron P1 that arborizes in layer 3 of the fan-shaped body. On entering the fan-shaped body, its projection bifurcates, one branch running anteriorly through one segment and arborizing there with spines, the other running along the caudal surface across the midline and sending blebbed endings into a segment that is separated from the ipsilateral segment by half the width of the fan-shaped body." [FlyBase:FBrf0049409, FlyBase:FBrf0210154]
is_a: FBbt:00007523 ! pontine neuron P1 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007528
name: pontine neuron P1b (Drosophila)
def: "Pontine neuron P1 (i.e. one that links contralateral segments of the fan-shaped body) that arborizes in several layers of the dorsal fan-shaped body." [FlyBase:FBrf0210156]
is_a: FBbt:00007523 ! pontine neuron P1 (Drosophila)

