id: FBbt:00013166
name: adult ostiolar valve (Drosophila)
def: "An ostiolar valve of the adult heart. These consist of deep inflections in the heart wall around each ostium, forming a pair of inwardly projecting flaps that acts as a valve." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003166 ! ostiolar valve (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:0015230 ! dorsal vessel heart

[Term]
id: FBbt:00013184
name: adult thoracic pericardial cell (Drosophila)
def: "Pericardial cell of the adult thorax. These cells are binucleate. There are about 10 on each side, anterior and lateral to the cardia, associated with the lower wall of the trachea leading to the fist spiracle and with the adult salivary gland suspensor muscle (FBbt:00003542)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "nephrocyte" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003184 ! adult pericardial cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003018 ! adult thorax

[Term]
id: FBbt:00013185
name: adult abdominal pericardial cell (Drosophila)
def: "Pericardial cell of the adult abdomen. These are serially arranges in a row of 20-25 on each side of the hear from the first to the 6th segment." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
synonym: "Pcl" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
is_a: FBbt:00003184 ! adult pericardial cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003023 ! adult abdomen

[Term]
id: FBbt:00013243
name: abdominal dorso-lateral adult muscle precursor cell (Drosophila)
def: "An adult muscle precursor cell of abdominal segments A1-7 that is located in a dorso-lateral cluster of abdominal adult muscle precursors. This cluster begins life as a pair of cells associated with the intersegmental nerve and connected to other abdominal adult muscle precursor cells in the same segment by filopodia (Figeac et al., 2010). The cluster remains associated with this nerve through most of development, but migrates to the epidermal histoblast nests where muscle formation is initiated during metamorphosis (Bate, 1993)." [FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0210887]
synonym: "DLAMP" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0210887]
synonym: "DLaP" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0100229]
synonym: "dorsolateral adult muscle precursor" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0210887]
synonym: "dorsolateral adult muscle precursor cluster abdominal" EXACT []
synonym: "dorsolateral adult precursor" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0100229]
is_a: FBbt:00003234 ! abdominal adult muscle precursor cell (Drosophila)

