[Term]
id: FBbt:00067064
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Gr21a/63a (Drosophila)
def: "Ipsilateral odorant receptor neuron that expresses Gr21a (FBgn0041250) (Couto et al., 2005) and Gr63a (FBgn0035468) (Kwon et al., 2007). It innervates antennal lobe glomerulus V. Unlike many other antennal olfactory receptor neurons, it does not send an axon branch through the antennal commissure to innervate the equivalent contralateral glomerulus. Suh et al., (2004) and Kwon et al., (2007) identify this neuron as being sensitive to CO2 levels. Its dendrite transduces signals from antennal basiconic sensillum ab1." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0179739, FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0192797]
