def: "Neuron whose dendrite innervates the terminal organ but whose soma is located in the dorsal organ ganglion rather than the terminal organ ganglion. The axons of these neurons project via the antennal nerve into area 4 of the subesophageal ganglion. There are 3 of these neurons per terminal organ." [FlyBase:FBrf0201176]
