id: FBbt:00100221
name: dopaminergic PPL2c neuron (Drosophila)
def: "A dopaminergic neuron whose cell body is located in a cluster of approximately 2 cell bodies in the cortex of the posterior lateral protocerebrum." [FlyBase:FBrf0208427, FlyBase:FBrf0216686]
