[Term]
id: FBbt:00100251
name: mushroom body beta'' lobe (Drosophila)
def: "A narrow division lying between the gamma and beta' lobes. Axons innervating the beta'' lobe have axons innervating the alpha' lobe front surface." [FlyBase:FBrf0162233, FlyBase:FBrf0205263]
