name: labral nerve (Drosophila)
synonym: "LbrN" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00001964 ! supraesophageal nerve (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100328
name: adult labral nerve (Drosophila)
def: "The adult labral nerve supplies the labrum. It enters the brain at the level of the tritocerebrum. It is fused with the frontal nerve, forming a labro-frontal nerve." [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
synonym: "LbrN" EXACT BRAIN_NAME_ABV [FlyBase:FBrf0224194]
is_a: FBbt:00100327 ! labral nerve (Drosophila)
