name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron DA4l adPN (Drosophila)
def: "Antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast lineage whose dendrites innervate only antennal lobe glomerulus DA4l. This neuron is born from the fifth division of the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346) during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
