[Term]
id: FBbt:00100369
name: adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron adPN (Drosophila)
def: "An adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron that is derived from the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346). All of these neurons have axons that fasciculate with the medial antennal lobe tract (mALT) and except for V adPN neurons, innervate the lateral horn." [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
is_a: FBbt:00007438 ! adult antennal lobe projection neuron adPN (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00007441 ! adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100370
name: multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron L1 adPN (Drosophila)
def: "Multiglomerular adult antennal lobe projection neuron of the adPN lineage. It is born from the 18th larval division of the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346), after the division that produced VC3 adPN. Its innervation targets include parts of glomeruli DC3, VC3 and VM4." [doi:10.1371/journal.pbio.1000461.g003, FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
synonym: "poly[L1] adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
is_a: FBbt:00100369 ! adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron adPN (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100371
name: multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron L2 adPN (Drosophila)
def: "Multiglomerular adult antennal lobe projection neuron of the adPN lineage. It is born from the 19th larval division of the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346), after the division that produced L1 adPN. Its innervation targets include parts of glomeruli VM4 and VL2p." [FlyBase:FBrf0211729doi\:10.1371/journal.pbio.1000461.g003]
synonym: "poly[L2] adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
