[Term]
id: FBbt:00100372
name: multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron L3 adPN (Drosophila)
def: "Multiglomerular adult antennal lobe projection neuron of the adPN lineage. It is born from the 20th larval division of the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346), after the division that produces L2 adPN. Its dendrites innervate glomeruli VL2p, VL2a and DL1l." [doi:10.1371/journal.pbio.1000461.g003, FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
synonym: "poly[L3] adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
