[Term]
id: FBbt:00100373
name: multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron L4 adPN (Drosophila)
def: "Multiglomerular adult antennal lobe projection neuron of the adPN lineage. It is born from the 21st larval division of the neuroblast ALad1 (FBbt:00067346), after the division that produces L3 adPN. Its innervation targets include parts of glomeruli VL2a, Dl1l, DL2v and DL2d." [doi:10.1371/journal.pbio.1000461.g003, FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
synonym: "poly[L4] adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
