[Term]
id: FBbt:00110021
name: antennal coeloconic sensillum ac2 (Drosophila)
def: "Coeloconic olfactory sensillum of the antenna that is innervated by three olfactory receptor neurons (ORN). It is distinguishable from ac1, ac3 and ac4 by its odor response profile (Yao et al., 2005) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (Benton et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187906, FlyBase:FBrf0206496]
is_a: FBbt:00004177 ! sensillum coeloconicum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110022
name: antennal coeloconic sensillum ac3 (Drosophila)
def: "Coeloconic olfactory sensillum of the antenna that is innervated by two olfactory receptor neurons (ORN). It is distinguishable from ac1, ac2 and ac4 by its odor response profile (Yao et al., 2005) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (Benton et al., 2009). The sensilla are present in the posterior antennal surface (Benton et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187906, FlyBase:FBrf0206496]
is_a: FBbt:00004177 ! sensillum coeloconicum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110023
name: antennal coeloconic sensillum ac4 (Drosophila)
def: "Coeloconic olfactory sensillum of the antenna that is innervated by three olfactory receptor neurons (ORN). It is distinguishable from a1, ac2 and ac3 by its odor response profile (Yao et al., 2005) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (Benton et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187906]
is_a: FBbt:00004177 ! sensillum coeloconicum of antennal segment 3 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110024
name: chamber I of sacculus (Drosophila)
def: "Ventral-most chamber of the sacculus of the antenna, where the opening is located (Shanbhag et al., 1995)." [FlyBase:FBrf0084361]
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004179 ! sacculus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110025
name: chamber II of sacculus (Drosophila)
def: "Middle chamber of the sacculus of the antenna. It has several compartments, each containing a single sensillum (Shanbhag et al., 1995)." [FlyBase:FBrf0084361]
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004179 ! sacculus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110026
name: chamber III of sacculus (Drosophila)
def: "Dorsal-most and largest chamber of the sacculus of the antenna. It has a ventral and a dorsal compartment, which differ in the type of sensilla they contain. The compartments are separated by a thick cuticular flap that extends lateromedially (Shanbhag et al., 1995)." [FlyBase:FBrf0084361]
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004179 ! sacculus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110027
name: sensillum of sacculus (Drosophila)
def: "Any sensillum (FBbt:00007152) that is part of some sacculus (FBbt:00004179)." [FBC:auto_generated_definition]
is_a: FBbt:00007241 ! adult head sensillum (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00004179 ! sacculus (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110028
name: antennal lobe glomerulus VM7d (Drosophila)
def: "Dorsal compartment of ventro-medial glomerulus 7." [FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0192533]
synonym: "antennal lobe glomerulus VM7 dorsal compartment" EXACT []
synonym: "VM7d" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00007094 ! antennal lobe glomerulus compartment (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003973 ! antennal lobe glomerulus VM7 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110029
name: antennal lobe glomerulus VC5 (Drosophila)
def: "Ventro-central antennal lobe glomerulus of the adult antennal lobe, dorsal to antennal lobe glomerulus VC3 lateral compartment (Endo et al., 2007)." [FlyBase:FBrf0192533]
synonym: "antennal glomerulus VC5" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00067500 ! adult antennal lobe glomerulus (Drosophila)

