is_a: CL:0000381 ! neurosecretory neuron
is_a: FBbt:00004101 ! peptidergic neuron (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110032
name: tachykinin cell of the embryonic/larval midgut (Drosophila)
def: "Cell of the embryonic/larval midgut that expresses tachykinin (FBgn0037976). In the late third instar, tachykinin expressing cells in the midgut are located posteriorly, just anterior to the attachment of the Malpighian tubules and have a morphology consistent with an endocrine role." [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "DTK" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "Locusta tachykinin-like immunoreactive cell" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "LTK-LI" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
is_a: FBbt:00001886 ! embryonic/larval midgut cell (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110033
name: medullary intrinsic neuron vGlutMinew1a (Drosophila)
def: "Medullary intrinsic neuron which projects along one medulla column forming some small lateral branches in layers M1-M5, until it reaches layers M8 and M9, where it arborizes extensively. It is a glutamatergic neuron (Raghu and Borst, 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
synonym: "Minew1a" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
synonym: "vGlutMinew1a" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0213690]
is_a: FBbt:00110094 ! medullary intrinsic neuron vGlutMinew1 (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110034
name: dorsal anterior lateral neuron of the protocerebrum (Drosophila)
def: "A neuron whose cell body is located in the adult dorsal anteriolateral protocerebrum (Xia et al., 2005), extending its dendrites mainly in the superior dorsofrontal protocerebrum. It projects its axons in three different regions: where the dendritic tree is located and in the dorsolateral and inferior dorsofrontal protocerebrum domains. It establishes synaptic contacts with the pioneer mushroom body alpha/beta neurons in a small dorsal frontal domain of the mushroom body calyx (Chen et al., 2012). There are two pairs of DAL neurons per hemisphere (Xia et al., 2005). These neurons are involved in the retrieval of long-term memories (Chen et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187341, FlyBase:FBrf0217453]
synonym: "DAL neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0187341]
is_a: CL:2000029 ! central nervous system neuron
relationship: part_of UBERON:6003624 ! adult brain

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110035
name: larval dorsomedial neurosecretory cell (Drosophila)
def: "Neurosecretory cell of the pars intercerebralis. Its axonal projection bifurcates, with one of the main branches projecting to the contralateral side and exiting the brain and bifurcating again. One of these secondary branches fasciculates with the nerve tracts that innervate the corpus cardiacum in the ring gland and also innervates the hypocerebral ganglion. The other follows the aorta and innervates the heart (Cao and Brown, 2001, Rulifson et al., 2002, Ikeya et al., 2002). The other main projection innervates the subesophageal ganglion, the esophagus (Rulifson et al., Ikeya et al., 2002) and the tritocerebrum (de Velasco et al., 2007). In third instar larva, the axonal processes project contralaterally and posteriorly, make a U-turn and extend anteriorly to terminals outside the brain. The dendritic processes extend ventrally and laterally (Cao et al., 2014). These cells are present in the mNSC bilateral cell body cluster of seven cells in each hemisphere (Cao and Brown, 2001, Rulifson et al., 2002, Ikeya et al., 2002, Cao et al., 2014)." [FlyBase:FBrf0136823, FlyBase:FBrf0149175, FlyBase:FBrf0151837, FlyBase:FBrf0193772, FlyBase:FBrf0224974]
synonym: "insulin producing cell" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0149175]
synonym: "IPC cell" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0149175]
synonym: "m-NSC" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0151837]
synonym: "median neurosecretory cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0151837]
synonym: "MNC" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0136823]
synonym: "mNSC" EXACT []
is_a: CL:2000029 ! central nervous system neuron
is_a: FBbt:00004011 ! dorsomedial neurosecretory cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001059 ! pars intercerebralis

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110036
name: Tachykinin cell of the adult midgut (Drosophila)
def: "Adult cell of the midgut that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976). These cells have an elongated shape, often spanning the gut epithelium, similar to the morphology of other midgut endocrine cells. They are found throughout the midgut except for a medial domain." [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "Locusta tachykinin-like immunoreactive neurons" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
is_a: FBbt:00007002 ! cell (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00003138 ! adult midgut (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110037
name: larval anterior large descending DN Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Larval neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the anterior protocerebrum and that innervates the ventral nerve cord. At the third instar larval stage, these neurons also form arborizations at two sites near the midline of the protocerebrum and in the subesophageal ganglion. At the level of the ventral nerve cord, this neuron has one main axon and two additional processes, one longer and one shorter than the main axon. There is one neuron per hemisphere (Winther et al., 2003; Siviter et al., 2000)." [FlyBase:FBrf0130087, FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "anterior large descending neuron DN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "larval tachykinin DN neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "tachykinin descending neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
is_a: FBbt:00110060 ! larval Tachykinin neuron of the central nervous system (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110038
name: pupal large descending DN Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Pupal neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the lateral protocerebrum and that innervates the ventral nerve cord (Winther et al., 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "anterior large descending neuron DN" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "pupal tachykinin DN neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "tachykinin descending neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
is_a: FBbt:00110062 ! pupal Tachykinin neuron of the central nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00110194 ! pupal brain (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110039
name: larval tritocerebral Tr Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "A larval neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the tritocerebral neuropils and that innervates the subesophageal ganglion. There are one to two pairs in first instar larvae, and three in the other larval stages (Winther et al., 2003; Siviter et al., 2000)." [FlyBase:FBrf0130087, FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "SEG tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "subesophageal ganglion tachykinin neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "tritocerebral neuron Tr" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "tritocerebrum tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
is_a: FBbt:00110060 ! larval Tachykinin neuron of the central nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6001920 ! insect embryonic/larval brain

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110040
name: pupal protocerebral LPP2 Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Pupal neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the lateral posterior protocerebrum and that innervates the superior median protocerebrum and fan-shaped body (Winther et al., 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "lateral posterior protocerebral LPP2 tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "pupal LPP2 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
is_a: FBbt:00110062 ! pupal Tachykinin neuron of the central nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of FBbt:00110194 ! pupal brain (Drosophila)

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110041
name: larval protocerebral Pr Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Larval neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976) and whose cell body and arborization are located in the dorsal or medial protocerebrum (Siviter et al., 2000). The number of neurons increases during larval stages: 5 pairs are observed at first instar stage and 11 at prepupal stage P1. In third instar larvae some of these neurons have bilateral arborizations crossing the midline by two commissures (Winther et al., 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0130087, FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "PC tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "Pr tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
synonym: "protocerebral tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0130087]
is_a: FBbt:00001366 ! supraesophageal ganglion neuron (Drosophila)
is_a: FBbt:00110060 ! larval Tachykinin neuron of the central nervous system (Drosophila)
relationship: part_of UBERON:6001925 ! embryonic/larval protocerebrum

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110042
name: pupal antennal lobes Tachykinin neuron (Drosophila)
def: "Pupal neuron that expresses Tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the cortex of the antennal lobes (Winther et al., 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "lateral posterior protocerebral LPP2 tachykinin neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
synonym: "pupal LPP2 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162212]
