def: "Projection neuron whose cell body is located dorsally to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (AMMC). It projects bilaterally via the superior AMMC commissure to innervate the AMMC zone A in both hemispheres and the ipsilateral inferior ventrolateral protocerebrum (IVLP) region, fasciculating with the superior AMMC commissure (Kamikouchi et al., 2009). It is electrically synapsed to the giant fiber neuron." [FlyBase:FBrf0085744, FlyBase:FBrf0201047, FlyBase:FBrf0207518, FlyBase:FBrf0211025]
