[Term]
id: FBbt:00111022
name: dopaminergic PAM neuron 11 (Drosophila)
def: "A dopaminergic neuron of the PAM cluster that projects to the alpha lobe slice 1 and the pedunculus. Dendritic arborizations are found in the superior medial, intermediate and lateral protocerebrum. There are less than 6 neurons of this type per hemisphere." [FlyBase:FBrf0227179]
