def: "A dopaminergic neuron of the PAM cluster that projects to the anterior-posterior layer of beta' lobe slice 1. Dendritic arborizations are found in the superior medial protocerebrum and crepine. There are between 13-14 neurons of this type per hemisphere." [FlyBase:FBrf0227179]
