id: FBbt:02000000
name: dorsal margin ommatidium (Drosophila)
def: "An ommatidial subtype located in a single row at the dorsal margin of the eye. This ommatidial subtype is specialised to detect the e-vector of polarized sunlight." [FlyBase:FBrf0180690]
is_a: UBERON:0000971 ! ommatidium

[Term]
id: FBbt:02000001
name: yellow ommatidium (Drosophila)
def: "Ommatidial subtype with stochastic distribution throughout the retina making up about 70% of all ommatidia. This ommatidial subtype is specialised to detect longer wavelengths (far UV + green)." [FlyBase:FBrf0180690]
is_a: UBERON:0000971 ! ommatidium

[Term]
id: FBbt:02000002
name: pale ommatidium (Drosophila)
