[Term]
id: UBERON:0000162
name: cloaca
namespace: uberon
def: "Common chamber into which the intestines and excretory system opens. Arises during development in all vertebrates, but in many it becomes subdivided, lost or incorporated into other structures" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cloaca, ISBN:0073040584]
