property_value: external_definition "the paired, lobulated, modified sebaceous glands of the corona, the neck of the glans penis, and the inner surface of the prepuce with pheromonal functions in male rodents; male preputial secretions strongly attract females, may accelerate estrus, and have been implicated in intermale aggression; homologous to the clitoral glands (aka female preputial glands) in female rodents; there is no true anatomical equivalent in humans." xsd:string {external_class="MP:0002717", ontology="MP"}
property_value: homology_notes "There is debate about whether humans have functional homologues to preputial glands." xsd:string {source="Human_homologoues"}

