def: "A secretory duct that transports sperm from the testis. In mammals this is a continuation of the epididymis and ends in the prostatic urethra where it terminates to form ejaculatory duct" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vas_deferens, http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, ISBN:0-683-40008-8, MGI:pvb, MP:0002769]
