[Term]
id: UBERON:0001132
name: parathyroid gland
namespace: uberon
def: "The parathyroid gland is an endocrine gland for secretion of parathyroid hormone, usually found as a pair, embedded in the connective tissue capsule on the posterior surface of the thyroid gland. Parathyroid regulates calcium and phosphorous metabolism." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parathyroid_gland, ISBN:0-683-40008-8, MP:0000678]
subset: organ_slim
subset: pheno_slim
subset: uberon_slim
