name: deep brachial artery
namespace: uberon
def: "The arteria profunda brachii (also known as deep artery of the arm and the deep brachial artery) is a large vessel which arises from the medial and back part of the brachial, just below the lower border of the Teres major. [WP,unvetted]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deep_brachial_artery]
