name: cerebral vein
namespace: uberon
def: "The cerebral veins are divisible into external and internal groups according to the outer surfaces or the inner parts of the hemispheres they drain into. The external veins are the superior cerebral veins, inferior cerebral veins, and middle cerebral vein. [WP,unvetted]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cerebral_veins]
