[Term]
id: UBERON:0001703
name: neurocranium
namespace: uberon
def: "Subdivision of skeletal system that surrounds and protects the brain. Includes the skull base, sensory capsules and the central part of the skull roof." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuroranium, http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/11523816, TAO:MAH, ZFA:0001580]
