[Term]
id: UBERON:0001736
name: submandibular gland
namespace: uberon
def: "Either of the paired compound tubuloalveolar (aka tubuloacinar) major salivary glands composed of both serous and mucous secretory cells and situated beneath the mandible." [https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1432-0436.2006.00088.x, MGI:anna]
