[Term]
id: UBERON:0001911
name: mammary gland
namespace: uberon
def: "A specialized accessory gland of the skin of mammals that secretes milk. The gland is typically only developed in females, and regresses in males." [BTO:0000817, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mammary_gland, http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
