[Term]
id: UBERON:0002125
name: thymus lobule
namespace: uberon
def: "A lobule that is part of a thymus. Divided into an outer cortex and inner medulla and separated from each other by connective tissue septa, but with the medullary tissue continuous from lobule to lobule.[ncit,modified]." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, ncithesaurus:Thymic_Lobule]
