[Term]
id: UBERON:0004059
name: spinal cord medial motor column
namespace: uberon
def: "The subclasses of motor neurons which project their axons to axial muscles that lie close to the vertebral column; motor neurons in the lateral subdivision of the MMC project their axons to body wall muscles" [MP:0009686]
