[Term]
id: UBERON:0004874
name: somatopleure
namespace: uberon
def: "A structure created during embryogenesis when the lateral mesoderm splits into two layers - the outer (or somatic) layer becomes applied to the inner surface of the ectoderm, and with it forms the somatopleure.[WP]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somatopleure]
xref: EHDAA2:0001847
xref: EHDAA:381
