relationship: part_of UBERON:0003081 {source="EHDAA2"} ! lateral plate mesoderm
property_value: development_notes "Gives rise to the paired appendages in jawed vertebrates. a persistent somatopleure through the redistribution and expansion of the lateral plate mesoderm is a synapomorphy for gnathostomes and a critical step in generating a novel developmental module with dramatic evolutionary potentia (Tulenko et al. 2012) http://burkelab.research.wesleyan.edu/current-projects/lamprey/" xsd:string
property_value: external_ontology_notes "sources differ as to whether this is part-of or develops-from the LPM" xsd:string

