[Term]
id: UBERON:0005114
name: metanephric ascending thin limb
namespace: uberon
def: "The metanephric ascending thin limb is a segment of a nephron tubule in the metanephros lying in the inner medulla that is permeable to ions but not to water and has a simple epithelium; active transepithelial solute transport is absent[GO]." [GO:0072218]
