property_value: external_definition "The outermost layer of a blood vessel, surrounding the tunica media. It is mainly composed of collagen. The collagen serves to anchor the blood vessel to nearby organs, giving it stability[Wikipedia:Tunica_externa_(vessels)]." xsd:string {source="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tunica_externa_(vessels)"}

