[Term]
id: UBERON:0005919
name: supreme nasal concha
namespace: uberon
def: "A thin bony plate occasionally found projecting from the inner wall of the ethmoid labyrinth, above the bony superior nasal concha, and the mucous membrane covering the plate." [http://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/supreme+nasal+concha]
synonym: "concha nasi suprema" EXACT LATIN [FMA:57457, FMA:TA]
synonym: "highest nasal concha" EXACT [FMA:57457]
synonym: "supreme nasal turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57457]
synonym: "supreme turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57457]
xref: FMA:57457
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/361935003
is_a: UBERON:0003973 ! nasal concha of ethmoid bone

[Term]
id: UBERON:0005920
name: superior nasal concha
namespace: uberon
def: "The back part of the medial surface of the labyrinth of ethmoid is subdivided by a narrow oblique fissure, the superior meatus of the nose, bounded above by a thin, curved plate, the superior nasal concha. The bone found in superior nasal concha is part of the ethmoid bone." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_nasal_concha]
synonym: "superior concha" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_nasal_concha]
synonym: "superior nasal turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57458]
synonym: "superior turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57458]
xref: FMA:57458
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_nasal_concha
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/361934004
is_a: UBERON:0003973 ! nasal concha of ethmoid bone

[Term]
id: UBERON:0005921
name: middle nasal concha
namespace: uberon
def: "The medial surface of the labyrinth of ethmoid consists of a thin lamella, which descends from the under surface of the cribriform plate, and ends below in a free, convoluted margin, the middle nasal concha. It is rough, and marked above by numerous grooves, directed nearly vertically downward from the cribriform plate; they lodge branches of the olfactory nerves, which are distributed to the mucous membrane covering the superior nasal concha." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_nasal_concha]
synonym: "middle concha" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_nasal_concha]
synonym: "middle nasal turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57459]
synonym: "middle turbinate" EXACT [FMA:57459]
xref: FMA:57459
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_nasal_concha
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/361933005
is_a: UBERON:0003973 ! nasal concha of ethmoid bone

