relationship: part_of UBERON:0002073 ! hair follicle
property_value: editor_note "add cell type to CL" xsd:string
property_value: external_definition "Convex protrusion of the outer root sheath in the most distal permanent portion of the hair follicle, just below the sebaceous gland and at the insertion site of the muscle arrector pili. Contains the hair follicle stem cells." xsd:string {source="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2008.12.005"}

