synonym: "volar digital veins" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmar_digital_veins]
xref: FMA:70895
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmar_digital_veins
xref: http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/83229009
