namespace: uberon
def: "A hollowed out area on the medial margin of the kidney. The renal sinus opens at the renal hilum; it contains the renal aa. and vv., major calyces and renal pelvis, perirenal fat" [http://anatomy.uams.edu/anatomyhtml/kidney.html]
