synonym: "linea pectinata canalis analis" EXACT LATIN [FMA:75383, FMA:TA]
synonym: "pectinate line of anal canal" EXACT [FMA:75383]
synonym: "recto-anal junction" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pectinate_line]
synonym: "site of anal membrane" RELATED [EMAPA:19159]
