[Term]
id: UBERON:0006575
name: mantle
namespace: uberon
def: "A fold or lobe or pair of lobes of the body wall of a mollusk or brachiopod that in shell-bearing forms lines the shell and bears shell-secreting glands." [BTO:0000825, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantle_(mollusc)]
