def: "Loose connective tissue which consists of an irregular network of cells and reticular fibers and is spatially associated with myeloid and lymphoid cells. Examples: stroma of bone marrow, stroma of spleen, stroma of lymph node.[FMA]" [FMA:20116, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reticular_connective_tissue]
synonym: "reticular connective tissue" EXACT [FMA:20116]
synonym: "textus connectivus reticularis" EXACT LATIN [FMA:20116]
