synonym: "caput breve musculus bicipitis brachii" EXACT LATIN [FMA:37682, FMA:TA]
synonym: "caput breve of biceps bracii" RELATED [EMAPA:25055]
synonym: "short head of biceps brachii muscle" RELATED [FMA:37682]
xref: EMAPA:25055
xref: FMA:37682
xref: Origin_and_insertion
is_a: UBERON:0011906 {source="FMA"} ! muscle head
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000043 ! tendon
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001507 ! biceps brachii

