[Term]
id: UBERON:0007176
name: superior angle of scapula
namespace: uberon
def: "An angle of the scapula formed by the junction of the superior and vertebral borders. It is thin, smooth, rounded, inclined somewhat lateralward, and gives attachment to a few fibers of the Levator scapulae[WP,unvetted]" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superior_angle_of_scapula]
