[Term]
id: UBERON:0007329
name: pancreatic duct
namespace: uberon
def: "A duct that collects and carries secretions of the exocrine pancreas to the intestine." [GOC:cvs, GOC:ymb, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pancreatic_duct, https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/1250, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, ORCiD:0000-0002-2244-7917, ORCiD:0000-0002-9900-7880]
