[Term]
id: UBERON:0007334
name: nidopallium
namespace: uberon
def: "The nidopallium, meaning nested pallium, is the region of the avian brain that is used mostly for some types of executive functions but also other higher cognitive tasks." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avian_Brain_Nomenclature_Consortium, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nidopallium]
synonym: "nested pallium" RELATED [BTO:0003389]
xref: BTO:0003389
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nidopallium
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000203 ! pallium
property_value: terminology_notes "The region was renamed from neostriatum to nidopallium in 2002 during the Avian Brain Nomenclature Consortium because the prior name suggested that the region was used for more primitive functions" xsd:string

