[Term]
id: UBERON:0008294
name: feather barb
namespace: uberon
def: "One of a series of branches fused to the rachis (stem) of a feather. The barbs themselves also have branches called barbules, which have hooks that lock the barbs together[WP]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barb_(feather), https://en.wikivet.net/Feather_-_Anatomy_%26_Physiology]
