namespace: uberon
def: "The perichondrium consists of two separate layers: an outer fibrous layer and inner chondrogenic layer. The fibrous layer contains fibroblasts, which produce collagenous fibers." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Free_Encyclopedia]
xref: BTO:0005091
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Free_Encyclopedia
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002222 {source="BTO"} ! perichondrium

