[Term]
id: UBERON:0008544
name: splenius cervicis
namespace: uberon
def: "A muscle that arises from the spinous processes of the third to the sixth thoracic vertebrae and inserts into the posterior tubercles of the transverse processes of the upper two or three cervical vertebrae[WP,modified]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenius_cervicis_muscle]
