property_value: action_notes "Bilaterally: Extend the head & neck, Unilaterally: Lateral flexion to the same side, Rotation to the same side." xsd:string

[Term]
id: UBERON:0008546
name: iliocostalis cervicis muscle
namespace: uberon
def: "The iliocostalis cervicis (cervicalis ascendens) arises from the angles of the third, fourth, fifth, and sixth ribs, and is inserted into the posterior tubercles of the transverse processes of the fourth, fifth, and sixth cervical vertebrae.." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iliocostalis#Iliocostalis_cervicis]
