[Term]
id: UBERON:0008571
name: suprahyoid muscle
namespace: uberon
def: "A muscle in the region above the hyoid bone in the neck. The suprahyoid muscles include digastric, stylohyoid, geniohyoid, and mylohyoid." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suprahyoid_muscles]
synonym: "musculi suprahyoidei" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suprahyoid_muscles]
