namespace: uberon
def: "The levator labii superioris alaeque nasi muscle is, translated from Latin, the 'lifter of the upper lip and of the wing of the nose'. It has the longest name of any muscle in an animal." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levator_labii_superioris_alaeque_nasi_muscle]
