[Term]
id: UBERON:0008859
name: cardiac gastric gland
namespace: uberon
def: "A gastric gland in the cardiac region of the stomach; cardiac glands are fewer in number than in the fundus and body, and secrete mucin which coats the stomach and protects it[MP]" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiac_glands, MP:0010795]
subset: organ_slim
subset: pheno_slim
synonym: "cardiac gland" RELATED [FMA:14920]
synonym: "gardiac gland" EXACT [ISBN:0073040584]
