property_value: external_ontology_notes "FMA and MP disagree as to whether the oblique layer is middle or innermost. WP seems to agree that the oblique is inner" xsd:string {external_ontology="FMA"}
property_value: function_notes "This layer is responsible for creating the motion that churns and physically breaks down the food. It is the only layer of the three which is not seen in other parts of the digestive system. The antrum has thicker skin cells in its walls and performs more forceful contractions than the fundus" xsd:string

