property_value: external_definition "Any of the sensory nerves that innervate mechano- and electroreceptors of the lateral line system. The lateral line nerves may be separated in two components, anterior and posterior, in relation to the position of its roots with respect to the otic capsule. These nerves develop from lateral line placodes.[AAO]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-06-20", external_class="AAO:0010077", ontology="AAO", source="AAO:SIQ"}

