[Term]
id: UBERON:0008956
name: involucrum
namespace: uberon
def: "A layer of new bone growth outside existing bone seen in pyogenic osteomyelitis. It results from the stripping off of the periosteum by the accumulation of pus within the bone, and new bone growing from the periosteum." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Involucrum]
xref: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Involucrum
