def: "A renal, cortical lobule, consisting of the ascending or descending limbs of the loop of Henle or of the collecting tubules; medullary rays are regions where parallel arrays of straight tubules travel perpendicular to the capsule and extend from the cortex to the medulla." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bone_marrow_of_ovaryry_ray_(anatomy), MP:0011347]
