[Term]
id: UBERON:0009990
name: medial condyle of tibia
namespace: uberon
def: "The medial condyle is the medial portion of the upper extremity of tibia. It is the site of insertion for the Semimembranosus muscle[WP]." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medial_condyle_of_tibia]
