[Term]
id: UBERON:0010018
name: spiral valve of conus arteriosus
namespace: uberon
def: "The spiral valve alternately blocks & unblocks the entrances to the left and right pulmonary arches (sending unoxygenated blood to the skin & lungs)." [http://people.eku.edu/ritchisong/342notes9.html]
