[Term]
id: UBERON:0010040
name: stomach non-glandular epithelium
namespace: uberon
def: "Am epithelium that lines the stomach which lacks glands. In addition to a glandular epithelium, the stomachs of some vertebrates also has a second region characterized by a nonglandular epithelium, devoid of gastric glands." [ISBN:0073040584]
