[Term]
id: UBERON:0010306
name: bulbar conjunctiva
namespace: uberon
def: "The conjunctiva covering the anterior surface of the sclera and the surface epithelium of the cornea." [MP:0013402]
comment: covers the eyeball, over the sclera. This region of the conjunctiva is tightly bound to the underlying sclera by Tenon's capsule and moves with the eyeball movements.
subset: pheno_slim
synonym: "ocular conjunctiva" EXACT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conjunctiva]
xref: FMA:59024
xref: http://linkedlifedata.com/resource/umls/id/C0229275
