[Term]
id: UBERON:0010723
name: os vesalianum pedis
namespace: uberon
def: "An accessory bone located proximal to the base of the fifth metatarsal. Its prevalence has been reported to be from 0.1% to 1.0%. This bone is found within the peroneus brevis tendon and is considered to be asymptomatic in the majority of people" [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16291851]
