[Term]
id: UBERON:0011168
name: postfrontal bone
namespace: uberon
def: "A bone behind and above the orbit of which it commonly forms part of the border that is present in many vertebrates and corresponds to the postorbital process of the frontal bone of various birds and mammals" [http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/postfrontal]
