synonym: "greater tuberosity of humerus" EXACT [FMA:23390]
synonym: "tuberculum majus" EXACT LATIN [FMA:TA]
synonym: "tuberculum majus humeri" EXACT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greater_tubercle]
