name: rectus thoracis muscle
namespace: uberon
def: "Rectus thoracis is a very small quadrilateral muscle sheet from the lateral thorax runs from the 3rd-1st rib that is in continuation with rectus abdominis. Its functioning muscle in respiration." [MURDOCH:2224]
