[Term]
id: UBERON:0011577
name: flexural organ
namespace: uberon
def: "A portion of tissue that is the most anterior portion of the notochord. The flexural organ secretes Reissner's fiber-related proteins, including F-spondin." [https://sourceforge.net/tracker/?group_id=76834&atid=994726, ZFA:0007071]
xref: ZFA:0007071
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002328 {source="ZFA"} ! notochord
property_value: editor_note "we cannot classify as a secretory circumventricular organ, as this leads to unsatisfiability" xsd:string
property_value: taxon_notes "may be an ontogenetical remnant of the infundibular organ in cephalochordates" xsd:string

