name: splenial bone
namespace: uberon
def: "The splenial is a small bone in the lower jaw of reptiles, amphibians and birds, usually located on the lingual side (closest to the tongue) between the angular and suprangular." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenial]
