is_a: UBERON:0018544 ! trigeminal nerve muscle
property_value: taxon_notes "In some fishes such as the chimera and in tetrapods the palatoquadrate becomes fused to the braincase and this muscle is absent." xsd:string {source="ISBN:0073040584"}

