name: calcaneocuboid joint
namespace: uberon
def: "Calcaneocuboid Articulation (articulation of the calcaneus with the cuboid). The ligaments connecting the calcaneus with the cuboid are five in number, viz. , the articular capsule, the dorsal calcaneocuboid, part of the bifurcated, the long plantar, and the plantar calcaneocuboid." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calcaneocuboid_articulation]
