id: UBERON:0013226
name: accessory lacrimal gland
namespace: uberon
def: "Serous gland with distended lumen. It includes the gland of Krause in the lacrimal sac and the gland of Wolfring on the inner surface of the upper eyelid. (NCI)" [ncithesaurus:Accessory_Lacrimal_Gland]
synonym: "glandulae lacrimales accessoriae" EXACT LATIN []
