[Term]
id: UBERON:0013397
name: stratum argenteum of choroid
namespace: uberon
def: "A silver reflective layer in the outer choroid, adjacent to the sclera, frequently present in fish larvae but not as frequent in adults." [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/14738502]
