relationship: part_of UBERON:0001776 ! optic choroid
property_value: taxon_notes "In species known to have a stratum argenteum as adults, like the toadfish (Toad- fishes), the tapetum lucidum is absent or vestigial and there is little choroidal melanin[PMID:14738502]" xsd:string

