[Term]
id: UBERON:0013417
name: epicranium
namespace: uberon
def: "The Epicranium is the medical term for the collection of structures covering the cranium. It consists of the muscles, aponeurosis, and skin." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epicranium]
