namespace: uberon
def: "The sphenopetrosal fissure (or sphenopetrosal suture) is the cranial suture between the sphenoid bone and the petrous portion of the temporal bone. It is in the middle cranial fossa." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sphenopetrosal_fissure]
synonym: "fissura sphenopetrosa" EXACT [FMA:TA]
synonym: "sphenopetrosal fissure" EXACT [FMA:75038]
