name: Brodmann (1909) area 14
namespace: uberon
def: "Brodmann Area 14 is one of Brodmann's subdivisions of the cerebral cortex in the brain. It was defined by Brodmann in the guenon monkey. No equivalent structure exists in humans." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brodmann_area_14]
