namespace: uberon
def: "The extraperitoneal space is the portion of the abdomen and pelvis which does not lie within peritoneum. It includes: Retroperitoneal space Retropubic space The space in the pelvis is divided into the following components: prevesical space perivesical space perirectal space" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extraperitoneal_space]
