[Term]
id: UBERON:0015156
name: terminal branch of ophthalmic artery
namespace: uberon
def: "The two terminal branches of the ophthalmic artery in humans are the dorsal nasal artery and the supratrochlear artery" [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dorsal_nasal_artery, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supratrochlear_artery]
