[Term]
id: UBERON:0016504
name: umbilical ring
namespace: uberon
def: "A dense fibrous ring surrounding the umbilicus at birth. At about the sixth week of embryological development, the midgut herniates through the umbilical ring; four weeks later it returns to the abdominal cavity and rotates around the superior mesenteric artery." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Umbilical_ring]
