[Term]
id: UBERON:0016926
name: mucus body coating
namespace: uberon
def: "A coating of mucus that is produced by the skin and covers all or most of the body of an animal." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165]
synonym: "mucous body coating" RELATED []
xref: BTO:0005082
is_a: UBERON:0010152 ! skin mucus
property_value: function_notes "The epidermal mucus of fish regulates swimming speed by controlling the hydrodynamic resistance of the skin surface. The mucus is also presumed to serve as a defence against pathogenic organisms and is intimately associated with osmoregulation." xsd:string {source="BTO:0005082"}

