namespace: uberon
def: "Adrenal tissue aggregated in a dorsal layer covering internal cords, found in lepidosaur adrenal glands. Islets of adrenal tissue found on ventral surface of gland (barely present in squamates). See Yadav, 2008." [PHENOSCAPE:nizar]
