[Term]
id: UBERON:0018329
name: interpterygoid region
namespace: uberon
def: "The region on the palate corresponding to the location of the pterygoid bone, if present and between the palatine bones and the parasphenoid if not." [PHENOSCAPE:alex]
is_a: UBERON:0005913 ! zone of bone organ
relationship: part_of UBERON:0012072 ! palatal part of dermatocranium
