relationship: part_of UBERON:0012072 ! palatal part of dermatocranium

[Term]
id: UBERON:0018331
name: intraramal joint
namespace: uberon
def: "A joint in the lower jaw that enhances kinesis and for swallowing prey. Allows enhanced mobility and intraramal bending to increase gape." [PHENOSCAPE:alex]
