relationship: part_of UBERON:0002257 ! ventral horn of spinal cord
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005853 ! sacral spinal cord ventral column
property_value: function_notes "involved in the maintenance of micturition and defecatory continence, as well as muscular contraction during orgasm." xsd:string
