[Term]
id: UBERON:0035106
name: raphe of perineum
namespace: uberon
def: "The perineal raphe extends from the anus, through the mid-line of the scrotum (scrotal raphe) and upwards through the posterior mid-line aspect of the penis (penile raphe)." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perineal_raphe]
