[Term]
id: UBERON:0035922
name: intraculminate fissure of cerebellum
namespace: uberon
def: "A fissure that divides the culmen lobule (lobules IV and V)" [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/1953602, MP:000999, UBERON:cjm]
synonym: "fissura intraculminalis" EXACT LATIN [FMA:TA]
synonym: "ICF" RELATED ABBREVIATION [DHBA:266441729]
synonym: "intraculminate fissure" EXACT [FMA:83737]
