[Term]
id: UBERON:0036216
name: tympanic nerve
namespace: uberon
def: "The tympanic nerve (nerve of Jacobson) is a branch of the glossopharyngeal nerve found near the ear." [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tympanic_nerve]
synonym: "jacobson%27s nerve" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tympanic_nerve]
synonym: "nerve of jacobson" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tympanic_nerve]
