[Term]
id: UBERON:2001997
name: parietal-supraoccipital
namespace: uberon/phenoscape-anatomy
def: "Compound dermal and endochondral bone that results from the fusion of the paired dermal parietal bones and the median endochondral supraoccipital. Forms the dorso-posterior element of the dermatocranium." [TAO:GA_TG]
comment: A parietal-supraoccipital or parieto-supraoccipital bone is an element present in Siluriformes.
