comment: The arrangement of spikes originally had no distinct name; the term Thagomizer was coined in 1982 by cartoonist Gary Larson in his comic 'The Far Side', and thereafter became gradually adopted as an informal term within scientific circles, research, and education. {xref="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thagomizer"}
synonym: "tail spikes" BROAD []
