def: "The pre-oral neuropils of the brain located above and some of it below the esophagus, comprising three fused ganglia (protocerebrum, deutocerebrum, and tritocerebrum) in the head." [FlyBase:FBrf0224194, http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/terms/terms.html]
