namespace: uberon
def: "This layer contains bundles of unmyelinated cone and rod photoreceptor axons terminating in the pedicles and spherules that synapse in the retinal outer plexiform layer (OPL)." [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21071737]
