def: "Male germ cell that is derived from spermatocytes and develops into spermatozoa." [ncithesaurus:Spermatid]
is_a: XAO:0000111 ! germ cell (Xenopus)
relationship: develops_from XAO:0003019 ! spermatocyte (Xenopus)

[Term]
id: XAO:0003153
name: larval immune system (Xenopus)
def: "The immune system of a postembryonic, hatched or immature tadpole, prior to metamorphosis." [XAO:curators]
is_a: UBERON:0002405 ! immune system

[Term]
id: XAO:0003154
name: adult immune system (Xenopus)
def: "The complete system of biological structures and processes within the adult organism that protects against disease by identifying and killing pathogens and tumor cells." [XAO:curators]
is_a: UBERON:0002405 ! immune system

[Term]
