[Term]
id: XAO:0003236
name: barrier epithelial cell (Xenopus)
def: "A surface epithelial cell of stratified squamous epithelium of cornea, tongue, oral cavity, esophagus or cloaca." [XAO:curators]
is_a: CL:0000000 ! cell

[Term]
id: XAO:0003237
