def: "A cell of ectomesenchymal origin concerned with the formation of the layer of cementum on the roots of teeth." [ISBN:0781733901]
is_a: CL:0000000 ! cell

[Term]
id: XAO:0003238
name: chondroblast (Xenopus)
def: "A cell which originates from a mesenchymal stem cell and forms chondrocytes (cartilage cells). Chondroblasts that become embedded in the matrix are called chondrocytes." [XAO:curators]
