def: "Type of epithelium that facilitates the transcellular transport of solutes. This transport can either be absorption, transport from lumen (apical membrane surface) to blood; or secretion, transport from blood (basolateral membrane surface) to lumen." [WEB:en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transcellular_transport]
