synonym: "sternohyoids" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: UBERON:0011648 ! jaw muscle

[Term]
id: ZFA:0000297
name: vagal lobe (Danio)
def: "The multi-tissue,  vagal lobe is a large, paired brain stem structure flanking the unpaired facial lobe laterally.  The vagal lobe contains motor and gustatory neurons. While some degree of histological segregation is apparent within the vagal lobe, a clear lamination, as seen in goldfish or carp is absent." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-1280]
synonym: "LX" EXACT [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-1280]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001896 ! medulla oblongata

[Term]
id: ZFA:0000299
name: ventral entopeduncular nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)
def: "Peripheral nucleus of the ventral telencephalon that is a band of tightly packed cells starting at the level of the anterior commissure and extends into the telencephalo-diencephalic boundary region. From Neuroanatomy of the Zebrafish Brain." [ISBN:3764351209, ZFA:curator]
synonym: "endopeduncular nucleus, ventral part" EXACT []
synonym: "entopeduncular nucleus, ventral part" EXACT []
synonym: "ENv" EXACT []
synonym: "nucleus entopeduncularis, pars ventralis" EXACT []
synonym: "ventral entopeduncular nucleus V" EXACT []
is_a: ZFA:0001667 ! peripheral nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0000302
name: ventral habenular nucleus (Danio)
def: "Habenular nucleus positioned ventromedially to the dorsal habenular nuclei. The ventral habenular nuclei are paired and symmetrical, each have a conical shape defined by a wide rostral end, occupying the entire anterior region of the habenula, and a narrow caudal end. The axons of the ventral habenular nucleus passed laterally through the interpeduncular nucleus and projected to the ventral part of the median raphe.  The ventral habenular nucleus is homolog mammalian lateral habenular nucleus." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-100202-7, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120709-5]
is_a: UBERON:0008993 ! habenular nucleus

