[Term]
id: ZFA:0001086
name: muscle pioneer (Danio)
def: "Cells that develop from adaxial  that express engrailed and do not migrate completely to the lateral surface of the myotome, and instead extend from the notochord to the lateral surface of the somite, at the level of the future horizontal myoseptum." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961219-12]
synonym: "muscle pioneers" EXACT PLURAL []
synonym: "non migratory adaxial cells" EXACT []
relationship: develops_from ZFA:0000003 ! adaxial cell (Danio)
relationship: part_of CL:0000189 ! slow muscle cell

