[Term]
id: ZFA:0001203
name: ciliary zone (Danio)
def: "Multi-tissue structure that attach the zonules, that suspend the lens,  to the eye.  The ciliary zone secretes aqueous humor.  Unlike mammals zebrafish the ciliary zone dose  not contain processes or a circumferential band of muscle." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-050701-15]
synonym: "ciliary bodies" RELATED PLURAL []
synonym: "ciliary body" RELATED []
synonym: "ciliary epithelial zone" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0000073 ! regional part of nervous system
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001801 ! anterior segment of eyeball

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001322
name: dorsoventral diencephalic tract (Danio)
def: "A tract originating in the epiphysis and fasciculating with the tract of the postoptic commissure dorsal to the ventral flexure." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-719, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-955]
synonym: "DVDT" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0003931 ! diencephalic white matter

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001339
name: nucleus of the tract of the anterior commissure (Danio)
def: "Telencephalic nucleus from which the axons of the anterior commissure originate." [ZFA:curator]
synonym: "ntAC" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0009663 ! telencephalic nucleus

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001373
name: migratory slow muscle precursor cell (Danio)
def: "Cells that initially are located adjacent to the spinal cord and notochord that migrate from their initial medial position radially through the myotome to the lateral surface of the somites." [ZFA:curator, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961219-12]
synonym: "migratory slow muscle precursor cells" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: CL:0000000 ! cell
is_a: UBERON:0004120 ! mesoderm-derived structure
relationship: develops_from ZFA:0000003 ! adaxial cell (Danio)
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002329 ! somite

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001473
name: deep blastomere (Danio)
def: "Cells (completely cleaved), located underneath the superficial blastomeres and internal to the marginal blastomeres." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-576]
synonym: "deep blastomeres" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: ZFA:0000093 ! blastomere (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001484
name: superficial blastomere (Danio)
def: "Cells (completely cleaved), located at the surface of the blastodisc, above the deep blastomeres." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-576]
synonym: "superficial blastomeres" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: ZFA:0000093 ! blastomere (Danio)

