[Term]
id: ZFA:0001570
name: unfertilized egg (Danio)
def: "A female gamete where meiosis has progressed to metaphase II and is able to participate in fertilization.  In zebrafish specified to be outside the body." [ISBN:0721662544]
synonym: "activated oocyte" EXACT []
synonym: "egg" EXACT []
is_a: CL:0000000 ! cell
is_a: UBERON:0004120 ! mesoderm-derived structure
relationship: develops_from ZFA:0001569 ! oocyte stage V (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001624
name: pronephric distal late tubule (Danio)
def: "Portion of the pronephric duct (or tubule as described by Wingert et al, 2007) which is just posterior to the distal early tubule." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-071029-9]
synonym: "distal late tubules" EXACT PLURAL []
relationship: part_of UBERON:0003060 ! pronephric duct

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001625
name: optic nerve head (Danio)
def: "Portion of cranial nerve II where large fascicles of axons from the optic fiber layer come together prior to leaving the eye." [ZFA:curator]
synonym: "optic nerve heads" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: UBERON:0011779 ! nerve of head region
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000941 ! cranial nerve II

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001666
name: periventricular nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)
def: "Telencephalic nucleus which is in contact with the median ependymal lining of the ventricle and consists of the dorsal, ventral, supracommissural and postcommissural nuclei of the ventral telencephalon. From Neuroanatomy of the Zebrafish Brain." [ISBN:3764351209, ZFA:curator]
is_a: UBERON:0009663 ! telencephalic nucleus
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000204 ! ventral part of telencephalon

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001667
name: peripheral nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)
def: "Telencephalic nucleus which has migrated away from the ependyma and consists of the central, lateral nuclei and the dorsal and ventral entopeduncular nuclei. From Neuroanatomy of the Zebrafish Brain." [ISBN:3764351209, ZFA:curator]
is_a: UBERON:0009663 ! telencephalic nucleus
relationship: part_of UBERON:0000204 ! ventral part of telencephalon

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001668
name: central nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)
def: "Peripheral nucleus of the ventral telencephalon which is located immediately lateral to the dorsal nucleus of the ventral telencephalon. From Neuroanatomy of the Zebrafish Brain." [ISBN:3764351209, ZFA:curator]
synonym: "area ventralis telencephali, nucleus centralis" EXACT []
is_a: ZFA:0001667 ! peripheral nucleus of ventral telencephalon (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001673
name: pronephric podocyte (Danio)
def: "Podocyte that is part of the pronephros." [ZFA:curator]
is_a: CL:0000653 ! glomerular visceral epithelial cell
relationship: part_of UBERON:0004739 ! pronephric glomerulus

[Term]
id: ZFA:0001674
name: mesonephric podocyte (Danio)
def: "Podocyte that is part of the kidney (mesonephros)." [ZFA:curator]
