id: ZFA:0005667
name: ventral spinal nerve median branch (Danio)
def: "Ventral spinal nerve sub-branch that projects ventrally in the rostro-caudal center of the myotome. The axon of the CaP primary motoneuron extends in this branch." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-1247, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-814]
is_a: ZFA:0005665 ! ventral spinal nerve (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005668
name: olfactory bulb protoglomerulus (Danio)
def: "Multi-tissue structure part of the olfactory bulb comprised of ciliated and microvillous olfactory sensory neurons projections that form specialized neuropilar regions comprised of olfactory sensor axons and the dendrites of olfactory bulb neurons." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120330-2]
synonym: "glomerular precursors" EXACT []
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005669
name: lateral protoglomerulus (Danio)
def: "Protoglomeruli in the lateral  region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-050617-6, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
synonym: "lateral protoglomeruli" EXACT PLURAL []
is_a: ZFA:0005668 ! olfactory bulb protoglomerulus (Danio)
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005675 ! lateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005670
name: central zone protoglomerulus (Danio)
def: "Protoglomeruli in the central zone  of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb.  The central zone protoglomeruli have somewhat indistinct boundaries." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
is_a: ZFA:0005668 ! olfactory bulb protoglomerulus (Danio)
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005673 ! central zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005671
name: medial protoglomerulus (Danio)
def: "Protoglomeruli in the medial  region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-050617-6, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
is_a: ZFA:0005668 ! olfactory bulb protoglomerulus (Danio)
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005676 ! medial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005672
name: ventral posterior glomerulus (Danio)
def: "Single large glomerulus located in the ventral posterior region of the maturing glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
synonym: "VPG" RELATED []
is_a: ZFA:0005668 ! olfactory bulb protoglomerulus (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005673
name: central zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Central region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005674
name: dorsal zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Dorsal region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005675
name: lateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Lateral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb.  The lateral region of the olfactory bulb consisted of morphologically diverse glomeruli and a diffuse aggregate of OSN axons, the lateral plexus." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005676
name: medial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Medial region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005677
name: ventral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Ventral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-980729-35]
relationship: part_of UBERON:0005377 ! olfactory bulb glomerular layer

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005678
name: dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Lateral region of the dorsal zone of the olfactory bulb. Glomeruli in this zone are tightly clustered in both male and female fish." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-050523-2, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-101222-42, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005674 ! dorsal zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005679
name: ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Medial portion of the ventral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005677 ! ventral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005680
name: ventroanterior zone of olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Anterior portion of the ventral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb. In the ventroanterior zone there are  typically seven small glomeruli located 11-20 micrometers beneath the superficial axon bundles  The ganglion differed conspicuously in sizes, shapes, and distribution, and were not individually  identifiable." [ZFA:CVS, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "vaGx" RELATED []
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005677 ! ventral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005681
name: ventroposterior zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Posterior portion of the ventral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005677 ! ventral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005682
name: mediodorsal zone of the olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Dorsal part of the medial region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS]
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005676 ! medial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005683
name: anteromedial  zone olfactory bulb (Danio)
def: "Anterior portion of the medial region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS]
synonym: "medial anterior zone olfactory bulb" EXACT []
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005676 ! medial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005684
name: posteromedial glomerulus (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located between ventromedial and medial olfactory bulb surfaces. The mpG is generally  elongated and innervated by a single thick axon." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-050523-2, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-961014-62]
synonym: "mpG" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005676 ! medial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005685
name: dG1 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsal zone of the olfactory bulb.  It is located in a stereotypic position near the posterior edge of the dorsal glomerular zone and stains with anti-calretinin." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsal glomerulus 1" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005674 ! dorsal zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005686
name: dlG1 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsolateral zone of the olfactory bulb.  Dorsalmost of glomeruli located along the caudal edge of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsolateral glomerulus 1" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005678 ! dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005687
name: dlG2 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsolateral zone of the olfactory bulb.  Ventral to dlG1 and located along the caudal edge of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsolateral glomerulus 2" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005678 ! dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005688
name: dlG3 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsolateral zone of the olfactory bulb.  Ventral to dlG2 and located along the caudal edge of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsolateral glomerulus 3" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005678 ! dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005689
name: dlG4 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsolateral zone of the olfactory bulb.  Ventral to dlG3 and located along the caudal edge of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsolateral glomerulus 4" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005678 ! dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005690
name: dlG5 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the dorsolateral zone of the olfactory bulb.  Ventral to dlG4,  and located along the caudal edge of the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "dorsolateral glomerulus 5" RELATED []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005678 ! dorsolateral zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005691
name: vmG1 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Stains strongly with anti-calretinin. Anteriormost of the triplet of glomeruli strongly expressing calretinin." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventral triplet glomerulus 1" EXACT []
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 1" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005692
name: vmG2 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Stains strongly with anti-calretinin.  Posterior to vmG1 in the triplet of glomeruli strongly expressing calretinin." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventral triplet glomerulus 2" EXACT []
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 2" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005693
name: vmG3 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Stains strongly with anti-calretinin.  Posteriormost glomerulus in the triplet of glomeruli strongly expressing calretinin." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventral triplet glomerulus 3" EXACT []
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 3" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005694
name: vmG4 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Posterior to the triplet of  ventromedial glomeruli strongly expressing calretinin." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 4" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005695
name: vmG5 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Posterior to vmG4." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 5" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005696
name: vmG6 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. Posterior to vmG4 adjacent to vmG5." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 6" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005697
name: vmG7 (Danio)
def: "Glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. vmG7 is located anteriorly to vmG1-3 and vmG4-6." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerulus 7" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005698
name: vmGx (Danio)
def: "Group of glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb The vmGx group, is  located 10-50 micrometers from the ventral surface of the olfactory bulb. And were located anywhere between the posteroventral and anteroventral regions of the olfactory bulb. It was not possible to unambiguously identify the vmGx because they displayed varying distributions and numbers in the olfactory bulbs of different animals." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerular group x" EXACT []
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005699
name: vmGy (Danio)
def: "Group of glomerulus located in the ventromedial zone of the olfactory bulb. A cluster of comparatively small glomeruli located near the midline between the two olfactory bulbs The glomeruli in the  vmGy were among the smallest glomeruli in the olfactory bulb." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventromedial glomerular group y" EXACT []
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005679 ! ventromedial zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005700
name: vpG1 (Danio)
def: "One of two large glomeruli located in the ventroposterior zone olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventroposterior glomerulus 1" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005681 ! ventroposterior zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005701
name: vpG2 (Danio)
def: "One of two large glomeruli located in the ventroposterior zone olfactory bulb." [ZFA:CVS, ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-120516-14]
synonym: "ventroposterior glomerulus 2" EXACT []
is_a: UBERON:0005387 ! olfactory glomerulus
relationship: part_of ZFA:0005681 ! ventroposterior zone olfactory bulb (Danio)

[Term]
id: ZFA:0005702
name: lG1 (Danio)
